(630880, 65590, 6349, '<td valign="top">thanks you.  It''s about time someone submitted a good example of this type of shot.  I used to film skateboarding videos and I get frustrated by the examples I have seen of extreme sport photos.  You have correctly achieved the angle (did you use a wide angle or fish eye?) that gives a sense of height to the obstacles, power to the scene, and grandeur to the athlete.  Helps that you also have a great background.  10 from me.  Hope this ribbons.</td>', 'thanks you.  It''s about time someone submitted a good example of this type of shot.  I used to film skateboarding videos and I get frustrated by the examples I have seen of extreme sport photos.  You have correctly achieved the angle (did you use a wide angle or fish eye?) that gives a sense of height to the obstacles, power to the scene, and grandeur to the athlete.  Helps that you also have a great background.  10 from me.  Hope this ribbons.', '2004-03-22 01:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(630881, 65660, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your black speckles through this shot are very distracting and very easy to deal with in the advanced editing rules.  I''m confused as to why you would leave them in.  Overall the shot doesn''t have much interest or staying power.<br/>TC</td>', 'Your black speckles through this shot are very distracting and very easy to deal with in the advanced editing rules.  I''m confused as to why you would leave them in.  Overall the shot doesn''t have much interest or staying power.TC', '2004-03-22 01:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(630882, 65777, 9906, '<td valign="top">This appears to be overly zoomed (cropped) or overly processed.  I''m leaning on the zoom part.  Nice compositon, but the detail is lost or exagerated...<br/>TC</td>', 'This appears to be overly zoomed (cropped) or overly processed.  I''m leaning on the zoom part.  Nice compositon, but the detail is lost or exagerated...TC', '2004-03-22 01:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(630885, 65397, 9906, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is very harsh and you lose a lot of detail in the lady and gondoleer.  The composition is nice (if a tad busy).  I wonder if you had a little patience if you could have gotten the gondoleer without the arm in front of his face...<br/>TC</td>', 'The lighting here is very harsh and you lose a lot of detail in the lady and gondoleer.  The composition is nice (if a tad busy).  I wonder if you had a little patience if you could have gotten the gondoleer without the arm in front of his face...TC', '2004-03-22 01:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
