(631020, 65756, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very difficult to make a good image out of the randomness of nature but I think you have succeeded here. No doubt you will get lots of comments about the border but my view is that it helps you to visualise how the image would look on the magazine..so it`s a plus for me.</td>', 'Very difficult to make a good image out of the randomness of nature but I think you have succeeded here. No doubt you will get lots of comments about the border but my view is that it helps you to visualise how the image would look on the magazine..so it`s a plus for me.', '2004-03-22 05:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
