(631468, 65452, 14986, '<td valign="top">This shot looks tilted to the right.  I would straighten it.   The concrete wall really adds nothing to the shot.  Although I think the lighting is less than ideal, I think the shot could be helped a lot simply by cropping this to a portrait layout, focusing in on the waterfall and leaving out the concrete wall.</td>', 'This shot looks tilted to the right.  I would straighten it.   The concrete wall really adds nothing to the shot.  Although I think the lighting is less than ideal, I think the shot could be helped a lot simply by cropping this to a portrait layout, focusing in on the waterfall and leaving out the concrete wall.', '2004-03-22 10:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(631471, 65142, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a really odd shot.   It really doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'This is a really odd shot.   It really doesn''t appeal to me.', '2004-03-22 10:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(631473, 65699, 11800, '<td valign="top">I can see this on a artistic magazine. Good job matching the picture to the magazine.  High key effect is nicely done, but I wish there was a little more contrast, or perhaps one strong dark point.</td>', 'I can see this on a artistic magazine. Good job matching the picture to the magazine.  High key effect is nicely done, but I wish there was a little more contrast, or perhaps one strong dark point.', '2004-03-22 10:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(631475, 65906, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cute dog.  The lighting here is not good for the subject....we can''t really see the dog''s face much and the background is too bright.</td>', 'Cute dog.  The lighting here is not good for the subject....we can''t really see the dog''s face much and the background is too bright.', '2004-03-22 10:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(631477, 65579, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Kind of abstract looking.    I think it would make a good cover.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Kind of abstract looking.    I think it would make a good cover.', '2004-03-22 10:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(631492, 65595, 16829, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation of the subject , just not sharp enough to be effective.</td>', 'Nice presentation of the subject , just not sharp enough to be effective.', '2004-03-22 10:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(631493, 65905, 14614, '<td valign="top">just a tad closer to your subject would make this fine shot a perfect cover selection. as presented, nice job</td>', 'just a tad closer to your subject would make this fine shot a perfect cover selection. as presented, nice job', '2004-03-22 10:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(631510, 65668, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nice setup, but it seems a little blurry to me.</td>', 'A nice setup, but it seems a little blurry to me.', '2004-03-22 10:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(631511, 65377, 6388, '<td valign="top">that''s nuts.  :D<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'that''s nuts.  :D Pedro', '2004-03-22 10:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(631520, 65397, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot, but there are a couple things I would have done differently.  I think a vertical crop that included more of the boat might have been stronger.  It also looks like the blurriness of the background was largely added after the fact.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot, but there are a couple things I would have done differently.  I think a vertical crop that included more of the boat might have been stronger.  It also looks like the blurriness of the background was largely added after the fact.', '2004-03-22 10:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(631523, 65569, 3102, '<td valign="top">As a boat fan, I like it!  I might not have cropped it so tightly, though.</td>', 'As a boat fan, I like it!  I might not have cropped it so tightly, though.', '2004-03-22 10:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(631524, 65595, 14614, '<td valign="top">Yum!  You''ve nailed this one.  Nice job with the colors, setting, and composition</td>', 'Yum!  You''ve nailed this one.  Nice job with the colors, setting, and composition', '2004-03-22 10:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(631527, 65725, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured, although I''m a bit suspicious of the blurring here -- it doesn''t look like a realistic depth of field to me, particularly since the ground under the dog is just as out of focus as the rest of the background.</td>', 'Nicely captured, although I''m a bit suspicious of the blurring here -- it doesn''t look like a realistic depth of field to me, particularly since the ground under the dog is just as out of focus as the rest of the background.', '2004-03-22 10:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(631531, 65655, 3102, '<td valign="top">You must have cheered when you saw the challenge topic this week!  Nicely done, overall.  The focus could have been a little stronger here, but overall a job well done.</td>', 'You must have cheered when you saw the challenge topic this week!  Nicely done, overall.  The focus could have been a little stronger here, but overall a job well done.', '2004-03-22 10:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(631533, 65867, 3102, '<td valign="top">Dang, that is one NICE looking human being!  Excellent job all around... nice toning, excellent sharpness... did I mention she''s extremely nice looking? 10</td>', 'Dang, that is one NICE looking human being!  Excellent job all around... nice toning, excellent sharpness... did I mention she''s extremely nice looking? 10', '2004-03-22 10:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(631536, 65546, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ha!  That looks like the world''s worst-ever wedgie!</td>', 'Ha!  That looks like the world''s worst-ever wedgie!', '2004-03-22 11:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(631540, 65859, 3102, '<td valign="top">The colors seem rather funky here... a little too heavy on the reds.</td>', 'The colors seem rather funky here... a little too heavy on the reds.', '2004-03-22 11:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(631541, 65756, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is a picture of *what*?  There just doesn''t seem to be a focal point here at all.  There''s nothing of real interest to grab the eye, I''m afraid.</td>', 'This is a picture of *what*?  There just doesn''t seem to be a focal point here at all.  There''s nothing of real interest to grab the eye, I''m afraid.', '2004-03-22 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(631544, 65820, 11181, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot but it looks like its kinda leaning to the left.</td>', 'Excellent shot but it looks like its kinda leaning to the left.', '2004-03-22 11:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(631548, 65822, 11181, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot but a bit too soft on the focus.</td>', 'Beautiful shot but a bit too soft on the focus.', '2004-03-22 11:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(631554, 65585, 11181, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition! Actually its perfect! DOF is excellent... a bit bright on the white fur though but that must be tough to avoid. Well done! Hope you do well!</td>', 'Beautiful composition! Actually its perfect! DOF is excellent... a bit bright on the white fur though but that must be tough to avoid. Well done! Hope you do well!', '2004-03-22 11:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(631564, 65859, 11181, '<td valign="top">The color tone really makes this picture look like it belongs in those old Beetle car magazines! Excellent composition... Focus is spot on! Well done!</td>', 'The color tone really makes this picture look like it belongs in those old Beetle car magazines! Excellent composition... Focus is spot on! Well done!', '2004-03-22 11:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(631568, 65863, 17166, '<td valign="top">Not a very pretty shot, but great at conveying mood and theme.</td>', 'Not a very pretty shot, but great at conveying mood and theme.', '2004-03-22 11:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(631575, 65803, 17166, '<td valign="top">A different crop would help this photo.  Either zoomed out so that the two inboard engines were visible. Or maybe zoomed in with the lower right corner where it is and the upper left corner about at the refueling recepticle, which would put more emphasis on the crewman.</td>', 'A different crop would help this photo.  Either zoomed out so that the two inboard engines were visible. Or maybe zoomed in with the lower right corner where it is and the upper left corner about at the refueling recepticle, which would put more emphasis on the crewman.', '2004-03-22 11:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(631580, 65777, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.  I like the crop on this - keeping the rocks and spray in really adds to the drama of this photo.  Wish the surfer was a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice action shot.  I like the crop on this - keeping the rocks and spray in really adds to the drama of this photo.  Wish the surfer was a bit sharper.', '2004-03-22 11:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(631595, 65849, 16670, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2004-03-22 11:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(631598, 65602, 16670, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing and every bird ideally placed.</td>', 'Nice use of framing and every bird ideally placed.', '2004-03-22 11:37:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(631602, 65907, 16670, '<td valign="top">needs a person or something.</td>', 'needs a person or something.', '2004-03-22 11:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(631606, 65905, 16670, '<td valign="top">Place angler more to the left of the frame...looks crowded on the right!</td>', 'Place angler more to the left of the frame...looks crowded on the right!', '2004-03-22 11:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(631614, 65822, 4285, '<td valign="top">Top marks for your very journalistic take on the challenge. Great picture, great subject. More negative space at the top for the Time logo needed. I fear you are going to take a beating from the pro-Bush people among us though. Too bad it has to be so political.</td>', 'Top marks for your very journalistic take on the challenge. Great picture, great subject. More negative space at the top for the Time logo needed. I fear you are going to take a beating from the pro-Bush people among us though. Too bad it has to be so political.', '2004-03-22 11:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(631618, 65725, 4338, '<td valign="top">great photo !!!</td>', 'great photo !!!', '2004-03-22 11:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(631624, 64921, 4338, '<td valign="top">lovely shot, I love the spread on the feathers, but I would have like to have seen more of the pelican, but no points taken off for that...its still a great photo</td>', 'lovely shot, I love the spread on the feathers, but I would have like to have seen more of the pelican, but no points taken off for that...its still a great photo', '2004-03-22 11:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(631628, 65725, 7969, '<td valign="top">holy moses, this dog can fly!</td>', 'holy moses, this dog can fly!', '2004-03-22 11:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(631632, 65806, 4338, '<td valign="top">I really like the color of the water, a nice dark blue</td>', 'I really like the color of the water, a nice dark blue', '2004-03-22 11:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(631636, 65864, 4338, '<td valign="top">good shot......</td>', 'good shot......', '2004-03-22 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(631683, 65456, 18656, '<td valign="top">This picture is the greatest, really nice colors</td>', 'This picture is the greatest, really nice colors', '2004-03-22 12:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(631686, 65460, 16636, '<td valign="top">great photo - although a bit over sharpened for my taste</td>', 'great photo - although a bit over sharpened for my taste', '2004-03-22 12:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(631688, 65834, 16636, '<td valign="top">very ''eye'' catching!!!!!</td>', 'very ''eye'' catching!!!!!', '2004-03-22 12:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(631697, 65327, 16636, '<td valign="top">Really nice light and feel and an excellent photo, although for a magazine cover colour would sell better I think</td>', 'Really nice light and feel and an excellent photo, although for a magazine cover colour would sell better I think', '2004-03-22 12:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(631707, 65756, 18748, '<td valign="top">IT is a beautiful shot,but border is dominant in this composition. Yellow border takes over entire image.  7</td>', 'IT is a beautiful shot,but border is dominant in this composition. Yellow border takes over entire image.  7', '2004-03-22 12:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(631711, 65866, 18748, '<td valign="top">This is funny. She has that familiar look at her face that says "yeah, keep talking..."  8</td>', 'This is funny. She has that familiar look at her face that says "yeah, keep talking..."  8', '2004-03-22 12:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(631713, 65654, 16636, '<td valign="top">I know it was an overcast but maybe adjusting the colour balance would have brightened up your image, it''s a little bit cold - good composition though</td>', 'I know it was an overcast but maybe adjusting the colour balance would have brightened up your image, it''s a little bit cold - good composition though', '2004-03-22 12:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(631767, 65861, 16670, '<td valign="top">Where is the driver?</td>', 'Where is the driver?', '2004-03-22 13:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(631784, 65655, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve capture the feel of the magazine very well</td>', 'You''ve capture the feel of the magazine very well', '2004-03-22 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(631785, 65595, 10869, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but the plate is out of focus; would have been much better if it was in focus</td>', 'nice composition, but the plate is out of focus; would have been much better if it was in focus', '2004-03-22 13:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(631789, 65209, 2567, '<td valign="top">Perfect</td>', 'Perfect', '2004-03-22 13:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(631810, 65866, 10985, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect photo for Parenting Magazine. Any parent will relate to this kind of behaviour and expression in their child. And the photo is very well taken, perfect angle and expression.<br/>However the feet look like they''ve been brought forward in post-production. So much forward that she should be falling on her back, it seems. And they look like much cloning in has been done, which is very distracting. If not too many people notice this, she could win you a blue ribbon!</td>', 'This is a perfect photo for Parenting Magazine. Any parent will relate to this kind of behaviour and expression in their child. And the photo is very well taken, perfect angle and expression.However the feet look like they''ve been brought forward in post-production. So much forward that she should be falling on her back, it seems. And they look like much cloning in has been done, which is very distracting. If not too many people notice this, she could win you a blue ribbon!', '2004-03-22 14:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(631816, 65838, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great photo - how do you change the back wheel? Not seen anything like this before.</td>', 'Great photo - how do you change the back wheel? Not seen anything like this before.', '2004-03-22 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(631834, 65861, 12661, '<td valign="top">Well, at least somepeople realized that magazine covers need to leave some space for titles and text. Very well composed. Had there been more detail for the drivers, it would have improved a lot. But given the circumstances, it''s not easy to meter for light when the subject is zipping past you.</td>', 'Well, at least somepeople realized that magazine covers need to leave some space for titles and text. Very well composed. Had there been more detail for the drivers, it would have improved a lot. But given the circumstances, it''s not easy to meter for light when the subject is zipping past you.', '2004-03-22 14:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(631841, 65602, 12661, '<td valign="top">LOL. A bubble caption reading, "You want a piece of me" would fit perfectly here. It looks like that bird is picking a fight with you. The only thing I would change would be to adhust your settings to bring out more texture in the snow. It is hard to do but I have seen it done. Just don''t ask me how. Haven''t figured it out myself.</td>', 'LOL. A bubble caption reading, "You want a piece of me" would fit perfectly here. It looks like that bird is picking a fight with you. The only thing I would change would be to adhust your settings to bring out more texture in the snow. It is hard to do but I have seen it done. Just don''t ask me how. Haven''t figured it out myself.', '2004-03-22 14:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(631845, 65856, 12661, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition. Nice action shot, plenty of space for text and title, nice colors...  Excellent.</td>', 'Perfect composition. Nice action shot, plenty of space for text and title, nice colors...  Excellent.', '2004-03-22 14:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(631851, 65864, 12661, '<td valign="top">Photographically... very well done. Subject matter, however, is a bit missing. Mostly the lack of texture in the walkway. The large area of blant space below the bench pulls the attention away from the subject and offers little in itself. Maybe if you cropped the photo higher to remove the area under the front left leg and included more of the trees above it would have been more balanced and would have brought the subject lower allowing for space for the magazine title.</td>', 'Photographically... very well done. Subject matter, however, is a bit missing. Mostly the lack of texture in the walkway. The large area of blant space below the bench pulls the attention away from the subject and offers little in itself. Maybe if you cropped the photo higher to remove the area under the front left leg and included more of the trees above it would have been more balanced and would have brought the subject lower allowing for space for the magazine title.', '2004-03-22 14:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(631856, 65824, 12661, '<td valign="top">That is a wonderful concept and I could definately see something like this on the cover of Fortune. The only thing I would change is the composition. The main subject (the money guys) would look better on one of the lower corners and their shadows should be heating up to one of the top corners where they will be partly covered by the title.</td>', 'That is a wonderful concept and I could definately see something like this on the cover of Fortune. The only thing I would change is the composition. The main subject (the money guys) would look better on one of the lower corners and their shadows should be heating up to one of the top corners where they will be partly covered by the title.', '2004-03-22 14:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(631861, 65676, 12661, '<td valign="top">It'' s a beautiful subject. The photo itslef looks a bit washed (and I mean I am nitpicking bit, not a noticable bit), likely the result of the distance between you and the island. A little tweeking of the levels may have pulled more out of it.</td>', 'It'' s a beautiful subject. The photo itslef looks a bit washed (and I mean I am nitpicking bit, not a noticable bit), likely the result of the distance between you and the island. A little tweeking of the levels may have pulled more out of it.', '2004-03-22 14:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(631862, 65907, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very well composed. I have no trouble visualizing this as a cover for a travel magazine. Great, bright colors, a sense of freedom by the lack of clutter, and plenty of space for the title and text. Very well thought out and very well executed. Bravo.</td>', 'Very well composed. I have no trouble visualizing this as a cover for a travel magazine. Great, bright colors, a sense of freedom by the lack of clutter, and plenty of space for the title and text. Very well thought out and very well executed. Bravo.', '2004-03-22 14:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(631866, 65911, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the sun behinf the lighthouse effect, however, the resulting darkness of the subject takes much away. Increasing your aperature and reducing your exposure time will provide more light on the building. Unfortunately, if you overdo it, it can blow out the sky as well. If you get a chance to shoot again at that location, you may want to mess around with different aperatures to see what you can do. Failing that, there''s always dodging in photoshop. ;)</td>', 'I like the sun behinf the lighthouse effect, however, the resulting darkness of the subject takes much away. Increasing your aperature and reducing your exposure time will provide more light on the building. Unfortunately, if you overdo it, it can blow out the sky as well. If you get a chance to shoot again at that location, you may want to mess around with different aperatures to see what you can do. Failing that, there''s always dodging in photoshop. ;)', '2004-03-22 14:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(631871, 65700, 12661, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Clearly you had a magazine cover layout in mind when you framed this image. Also, the hiker''s viewpoint would speak to a hiker and invite them to pick up a copy. Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent composition. Clearly you had a magazine cover layout in mind when you framed this image. Also, the hiker''s viewpoint would speak to a hiker and invite them to pick up a copy. Nicely done.', '2004-03-22 14:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(631876, 65568, 12661, '<td valign="top">Groan!!!!! I don''t know what is worst. The fact that you submitted it or the fact that I laughed. ;-)<br/> <br/>As far as I am concerned, you get extra points for bravery. Good luck.</td>', 'Groan!!!!! I don''t know what is worst. The fact that you submitted it or the fact that I laughed. ;-) As far as I am concerned, you get extra points for bravery. Good luck.', '2004-03-22 14:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(631884, 65606, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of using an actual magazine cover as inspiration. My recommendations would be to use better chocolate to provide a smoother surface (I use toll house dark chocolate morsels melted in the microwave under low power when I dip strawberries. Only heat for 10-15 seconds at a time and stir between heatings, it tends to burn quickly). Also, the background is to monotonous. Something with a bit of texture would have added some depth.</td>', 'I like the idea of using an actual magazine cover as inspiration. My recommendations would be to use better chocolate to provide a smoother surface (I use toll house dark chocolate morsels melted in the microwave under low power when I dip strawberries. Only heat for 10-15 seconds at a time and stir between heatings, it tends to burn quickly). Also, the background is to monotonous. Something with a bit of texture would have added some depth.', '2004-03-22 14:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(631886, 65702, 12661, '<td valign="top">The DOF (blurred behind the title) works perfectly for a magazine cover. Very well done.</td>', 'The DOF (blurred behind the title) works perfectly for a magazine cover. Very well done.', '2004-03-22 15:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(631894, 65561, 12661, '<td valign="top">The composition and aspect ration is perfect for a magazine cover. I also really like the soft colors and the background. My only critique would be your choice of magazine title. "Reptile Hobbyist" or "Reptile &amp; Amphibian" would have been better suited. But the again, this isn''t a photo title contest.</td>', 'The composition and aspect ration is perfect for a magazine cover. I also really like the soft colors and the background. My only critique would be your choice of magazine title. "Reptile Hobbyist" or "Reptile & Amphibian" would have been better suited. But the again, this isn''t a photo title contest.', '2004-03-22 15:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(631896, 65824, 18485, '<td valign="top">cool shot, well executed--perfect tone, color and lighting.</td>', 'cool shot, well executed--perfect tone, color and lighting.', '2004-03-22 15:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(631898, 65896, 18485, '<td valign="top">really interesting shot.  maybe a little lacking in central focal point.  love the blur and DOF.</td>', 'really interesting shot.  maybe a little lacking in central focal point.  love the blur and DOF.', '2004-03-22 15:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(631901, 65588, 15810, '<td valign="top">Lovely wildlife shot, although I''m marking all "landscape" shots  a point lower as I don''t believe they fit the challenge parameters.</td>', 'Lovely wildlife shot, although I''m marking all "landscape" shots  a point lower as I don''t believe they fit the challenge parameters.', '2004-03-22 15:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(631902, 65546, 18485, '<td valign="top">such a cool photo, wish the background were blurred out a bit more...too distracting and a fixable problem with some careful dodging and bluring.</td>', 'such a cool photo, wish the background were blurred out a bit more...too distracting and a fixable problem with some careful dodging and bluring.', '2004-03-22 15:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(631904, 65699, 18485, '<td valign="top">great idea and treatment.</td>', 'great idea and treatment.', '2004-03-22 15:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(631906, 65905, 18485, '<td valign="top">perfect photo and POV.</td>', 'perfect photo and POV.', '2004-03-22 15:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(631907, 65655, 18485, '<td valign="top">could be a winner.  great shot...the long DOF with everyone in focus is surprisingly effective.</td>', 'could be a winner.  great shot...the long DOF with everyone in focus is surprisingly effective.', '2004-03-22 15:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(631908, 65656, 18485, '<td valign="top">simplicity wins!</td>', 'simplicity wins!', '2004-03-22 15:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(631910, 65660, 15810, '<td valign="top">I had a quick look on the internet but couldn''t find "poetry magazine". Interesting shot anyhow but  I''m marking all "landscape" shots  a point lower as I don''t believe they fit the challenge parameters.</td>', 'I had a quick look on the internet but couldn''t find "poetry magazine". Interesting shot anyhow but  I''m marking all "landscape" shots  a point lower as I don''t believe they fit the challenge parameters.', '2004-03-22 15:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(631911, 65863, 18485, '<td valign="top">might be a little TOO to the point...that''s some nasty air you found there.</td>', 'might be a little TOO to the point...that''s some nasty air you found there.', '2004-03-22 15:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(631913, 65659, 15810, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I really like this but I''m marking all "landscape" shots  a point lower as I don''t believe they fit the challenge parameters.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I really like this but I''m marking all "landscape" shots  a point lower as I don''t believe they fit the challenge parameters.', '2004-03-22 15:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(631915, 65822, 18485, '<td valign="top">GREAT great great great.  love the position, the relative desaturation.  the POV.  good work.</td>', 'GREAT great great great.  love the position, the relative desaturation.  the POV.  good work.', '2004-03-22 15:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(631916, 65603, 18485, '<td valign="top">nice shot and treatment.  i''m not entirely sure it would go on the cover of Nic magazine but i gave you high marks for technical merit and creativity.</td>', 'nice shot and treatment.  i''m not entirely sure it would go on the cover of Nic magazine but i gave you high marks for technical merit and creativity.', '2004-03-22 15:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
