(632216, 65590, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the viewpoint - it really gives a great feeling of the sport and provides a fascinating angle on that beautiful building behind. Let down by the unattractive dark scaffolding to the right for me but a great action shot.</td>', 'I love the viewpoint - it really gives a great feeling of the sport and provides a fascinating angle on that beautiful building behind. Let down by the unattractive dark scaffolding to the right for me but a great action shot.', '2004-03-22 17:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
