(632605, 65629, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic. It looks like someplace I wouldn''t want to be. The waves really add a wild mood to the shot. <br/>It looks as if you got some compression artifacts. It''s most obvious in the sky. Try saving the original as a tiff and editing that, then convert back to jpeg before you submit it to the challenge. I apologize if you didn''t get the artifacts from editing the picture as a jpeg.</td>', 'Very dramatic. It looks like someplace I wouldn''t want to be. The waves really add a wild mood to the shot. It looks as if you got some compression artifacts. It''s most obvious in the sky. Try saving the original as a tiff and editing that, then convert back to jpeg before you submit it to the challenge. I apologize if you didn''t get the artifacts from editing the picture as a jpeg.', '2004-03-22 22:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
