(633335, 65776, 17166, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo.  I''m still trying to decide how I feel about the border.  The left edge border disappearing behind the goblet is a nice effect, but the bottom border is a bit jarring with the way it just runs into the side of the image.  Still, it''s great to see this kind of experimentation and pushing the boundaries (pardon the pun) on DPC - I wish more photographers would do it.</td>', 'Pretty photo.  I''m still trying to decide how I feel about the border.  The left edge border disappearing behind the goblet is a nice effect, but the bottom border is a bit jarring with the way it just runs into the side of the image.  Still, it''s great to see this kind of experimentation and pushing the boundaries (pardon the pun) on DPC - I wish more photographers would do it.', '2004-03-23 11:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
