(633707, 65890, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like your shot.  the only thing that i could recommend, is possibly more tonal range.  the composition is really nice.  one of the better shots i''ve seen so far.</td>', 'i really like your shot.  the only thing that i could recommend, is possibly more tonal range.  the composition is really nice.  one of the better shots i''ve seen so far.', '2004-03-23 15:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
