(635686, 65725, 10644, '<td valign="top">great catch</td>', 'great catch', '2004-03-24 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(635688, 65897, 10644, '<td valign="top">nice..simplistic</td>', 'nice..simplistic', '2004-03-24 12:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(635693, 65585, 10644, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting and perspective</td>', 'i like the lighting and perspective', '2004-03-24 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(635699, 65124, 10644, '<td valign="top">love these birds....they are really characters!</td>', 'love these birds....they are really characters!', '2004-03-24 12:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(635700, 65866, 10644, '<td valign="top">nice expression</td>', 'nice expression', '2004-03-24 12:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(635704, 65875, 10644, '<td valign="top">i know how tough it is to capture these precious gems...i have to give a high mark just for the capture</td>', 'i know how tough it is to capture these precious gems...i have to give a high mark just for the capture', '2004-03-24 12:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(635706, 65881, 10644, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2004-03-24 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(635710, 65264, 10644, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting and contrast</td>', 'interesting lighting and contrast', '2004-03-24 12:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(635713, 65776, 10644, '<td valign="top">lovely composition</td>', 'lovely composition', '2004-03-24 12:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(635719, 65327, 10644, '<td valign="top">personally, i think flowers should always be in color</td>', 'personally, i think flowers should always be in color', '2004-03-24 12:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(635744, 65901, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  I like the composition....and, I like it in black &amp; white too...gives it an old-time feel.   I like ths smoke too....adds to the photo!</td>', 'nice photo.  I like the composition....and, I like it in black & white too...gives it an old-time feel.   I like ths smoke too....adds to the photo!', '2004-03-24 12:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(635748, 65887, 14593, '<td valign="top">great close-up   It would make a nice photo magazine cover.  The composition is perfect for a cover with lots of free space for text</td>', 'great close-up   It would make a nice photo magazine cover.  The composition is perfect for a cover with lots of free space for text', '2004-03-24 12:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(635752, 65593, 14593, '<td valign="top">great action with the duck......the water is muddy looking, but I''ve photographed many ducks at our local park and the water is somewhat similar.   great detail on the duck too....I like it!</td>', 'great action with the duck......the water is muddy looking, but I''ve photographed many ducks at our local park and the water is somewhat similar.   great detail on the duck too....I like it!', '2004-03-24 12:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(635760, 65465, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice pretty arrangment of flowers.....great color, sharpness, and detail too.   I like the way it is composed, and I like the black background.  This would make a great magazine cover</td>', 'nice pretty arrangment of flowers.....great color, sharpness, and detail too.   I like the way it is composed, and I like the black background.  This would make a great magazine cover', '2004-03-24 12:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(635765, 65127, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like this!   I like the framing of the insect against the pretty white flowers.  The blurry background is perfect....I wish the insect was more in focus, but I know that is hard to capture just right....nice photo, and it would make a great magazine cover too....I like the softness of the photo</td>', 'I like this!   I like the framing of the insect against the pretty white flowers.  The blurry background is perfect....I wish the insect was more in focus, but I know that is hard to capture just right....nice photo, and it would make a great magazine cover too....I like the softness of the photo', '2004-03-24 12:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(635770, 65460, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting photo......great dept of field.....love the colors and the water droplets</td>', 'interesting photo......great dept of field.....love the colors and the water droplets', '2004-03-24 12:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(635774, 65575, 14593, '<td valign="top">what a face on this beauty.....great coat too!  nice and crisp too</td>', 'what a face on this beauty.....great coat too!  nice and crisp too', '2004-03-24 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(635846, 65574, 14837, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites!  The heron is gorgeous and you got a great close up shot!  My ONLY gripe is that the backgound is a bit drab, maybe brighten it up some?</td>', 'This is one of my favorites!  The heron is gorgeous and you got a great close up shot!  My ONLY gripe is that the backgound is a bit drab, maybe brighten it up some?', '2004-03-24 12:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(635853, 65142, 14837, '<td valign="top">Not bad... Maybe a bit of color added to the "firey" hair would make this pop out!<br/></td>', 'Not bad... Maybe a bit of color added to the "firey" hair would make this pop out!', '2004-03-24 12:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(635855, 65725, 14837, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2004-03-24 12:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(635858, 65595, 14837, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, nice shot.  A bit blurry.  Maybe you could''ve got a bit closer to the food and have that as the main focal point.</td>', 'Nice set up, nice shot.  A bit blurry.  Maybe you could''ve got a bit closer to the food and have that as the main focal point.', '2004-03-24 13:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(635863, 65834, 4090, '<td valign="top">my only ten so far, very sharp and good dof, lovely colour, love to know how this was done.</td>', 'my only ten so far, very sharp and good dof, lovely colour, love to know how this was done.', '2004-03-24 13:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(635882, 65893, 489, '<td valign="top">Very evocative photo - I like the composition very much.</td>', 'Very evocative photo - I like the composition very much.', '2004-03-24 13:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(635945, 65568, 4767, '<td valign="top">Title alone is worth a medal!</td>', 'Title alone is worth a medal!', '2004-03-24 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(636163, 65723, 15642, '<td valign="top">Edges are breaking up...but very "Meet the Beatles"</td>', 'Edges are breaking up...but very "Meet the Beatles"', '2004-03-24 15:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(636187, 65549, 15810, '<td valign="top">Misread the brief? EDIT...Nope, it was me being stupid...apologies...I can see now this is very good but you are being naughty since no one else has been allowd the luxury of submitting the "finished" article with text...tsk tsk</td>', 'Misread the brief? EDIT...Nope, it was me being stupid...apologies...I can see now this is very good but you are being naughty since no one else has been allowd the luxury of submitting the "finished" article with text...tsk tsk', '2004-03-24 15:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(636189, 65760, 15642, '<td valign="top">Funny, but...1</td>', 'Funny, but...1', '2004-03-24 15:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(636195, 65901, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice, like the sepia''ish toning, really makes it look better than what I''d magine colour would be.</td>', 'Very nice, like the sepia''ish toning, really makes it look better than what I''d magine colour would be.', '2004-03-24 15:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(636196, 65621, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I can see this working really well. just for fun - Would true watercolour fans mind that it was a photopshop filter job and not a genuine watercolour i wonder?</td>', 'Great shot, I can see this working really well. just for fun - Would true watercolour fans mind that it was a photopshop filter job and not a genuine watercolour i wonder?', '2004-03-24 15:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(636200, 65905, 15810, '<td valign="top">great photo works really well with your low POV, must have been freezing in the water taking the shot.</td>', 'great photo works really well with your low POV, must have been freezing in the water taking the shot.', '2004-03-24 15:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(636208, 65209, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good clear view of his eyes, nice and sharp view of his whiskers and coat.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice, good clear view of his eyes, nice and sharp view of his whiskers and coat.  Well done!', '2004-03-24 15:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(636209, 65605, 15810, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this just looks like a snap to me with little thought about the placement of the magazine title and features text . I had a quick look on the net and it seems that the dogs face on the cover of the magazine is pretty much mandatory.</td>', 'I''m sorry but this just looks like a snap to me with little thought about the placement of the magazine title and features text . I had a quick look on the net and it seems that the dogs face on the cover of the magazine is pretty much mandatory.', '2004-03-24 15:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(636211, 65776, 15642, '<td valign="top">Never cork an opened bottle!</td>', 'Never cork an opened bottle!', '2004-03-24 15:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(636216, 65595, 15810, '<td valign="top">very interesting. The food on the plate (which would be the primary focus of the magazine) lacks a little crispness in focus and (if I may be so bold) looks unappetising.</td>', 'very interesting. The food on the plate (which would be the primary focus of the magazine) lacks a little crispness in focus and (if I may be so bold) looks unappetising.', '2004-03-24 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(636221, 65916, 15810, '<td valign="top">I had a look on the net and I think this would make an excellent cover for your chosen magazine. Well done, lovely colours and nice crisp focus.</td>', 'I had a look on the net and I think this would make an excellent cover for your chosen magazine. Well done, lovely colours and nice crisp focus.', '2004-03-24 15:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(636222, 65849, 12802, '<td valign="top">Haven''t I seen this shot before... Arnit?  Looking back through the challenges I could roughly remember when it was!  I liked the shot then, and I like it now.<br/> <br/>It does seem to slant down at the left though, the black outlines of cars? are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Haven''t I seen this shot before... Arnit?  Looking back through the challenges I could roughly remember when it was!  I liked the shot then, and I like it now. It does seem to slant down at the left though, the black outlines of cars? are a bit distracting.', '2004-03-24 15:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(636224, 65377, 12802, '<td valign="top">LOL, hope this was staged just for the challenge, and not some sort of normal daily clothing... :-)</td>', 'LOL, hope this was staged just for the challenge, and not some sort of normal daily clothing... :-)', '2004-03-24 15:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(636226, 65856, 15810, '<td valign="top">lovely captured moment, well focused and the exposure / lighting is lovely. I think with title and features text this would make a lovely cover for your chosen magazine (is it Aud&lt;b&gt;U&lt;/b&gt;bon)</td>', 'lovely captured moment, well focused and the exposure / lighting is lovely. I think with title and features text this would make a lovely cover for your chosen magazine (is it Aud<b>U</b>bon)', '2004-03-24 15:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(636231, 65907, 15810, '<td valign="top">great shot, nice and simple but beautifully composed. I think with title and features text this will lokk superb. Well done.</td>', 'great shot, nice and simple but beautifully composed. I think with title and features text this will lokk superb. Well done.', '2004-03-24 15:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(636239, 65875, 15810, '<td valign="top">wow stunning shot. I suspect a LOT of photoshopping went on here and you''ve come up with a brilliant cover shot for your magazine of choice. In my opinion the foreground flowers are a little unneccesary in your composition and detract from the brilliant humming bird. Superb work anyhow.</td>', 'wow stunning shot. I suspect a LOT of photoshopping went on here and you''ve come up with a brilliant cover shot for your magazine of choice. In my opinion the foreground flowers are a little unneccesary in your composition and detract from the brilliant humming bird. Superb work anyhow.', '2004-03-24 15:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(636243, 65339, 15810, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and really nice use of "artistic" filter. Great composition and colour too. The negative space you have left for magazine title and features text is intelligent and well placed.</td>', 'Lovely shot and really nice use of "artistic" filter. Great composition and colour too. The negative space you have left for magazine title and features text is intelligent and well placed.', '2004-03-24 15:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(636254, 65900, 15810, '<td valign="top">Wow, absolutely brilliant capture to get the ball in the frame (and if its photoshopping, nice work too) I can really see the magazine title and features text sittle comfortably within your submission. Excellent work.</td>', 'Wow, absolutely brilliant capture to get the ball in the frame (and if its photoshopping, nice work too) I can really see the magazine title and features text sittle comfortably within your submission. Excellent work.', '2004-03-24 15:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(636307, 65462, 16850, '<td valign="top">Really interesting, but on a cover?</td>', 'Really interesting, but on a cover?', '2004-03-24 16:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(636312, 65926, 16850, '<td valign="top">Tricky exposure</td>', 'Tricky exposure', '2004-03-24 16:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(636315, 65896, 16850, '<td valign="top">Soft focus on a cover?</td>', 'Soft focus on a cover?', '2004-03-24 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(636316, 65602, 6008, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice is the landscape orientation, but I''m sure a magazine layout editor could do something with it. Seems a tad underexposed, which is very easy to do with a white subject on snow, and also could do with a little more sharpening.</td>', 'First thing I notice is the landscape orientation, but I''m sure a magazine layout editor could do something with it. Seems a tad underexposed, which is very easy to do with a white subject on snow, and also could do with a little more sharpening.', '2004-03-24 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(636323, 65696, 16850, '<td valign="top">Detail, detail, detail. I like it.</td>', 'Detail, detail, detail. I like it.', '2004-03-24 16:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(636327, 65866, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant hair that seems to set the tone for the image. Her expression and body language compliments the perspective that you''ve shot in, akin to an adult looking down at her. The eyes are nicely sharp with good catchlights. A good shot!</td>', 'Very vibrant hair that seems to set the tone for the image. Her expression and body language compliments the perspective that you''ve shot in, akin to an adult looking down at her. The eyes are nicely sharp with good catchlights. A good shot!', '2004-03-24 16:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(636329, 65893, 16850, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, detail and all, but it looks like they are walking of into a dead end.</td>', 'I like the idea, detail and all, but it looks like they are walking of into a dead end.', '2004-03-24 16:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(636334, 65875, 16850, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful capture, humming bird and bees. Wish for more DOF tho.</td>', 'What a wonderful capture, humming bird and bees. Wish for more DOF tho.', '2004-03-24 16:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(636336, 65668, 16850, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the soft focus</td>', 'Don''t like the soft focus', '2004-03-24 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(636340, 65434, 16850, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2004-03-24 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(636342, 65395, 6008, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be on the top petals that received the light and the lower petal with the water drop(?) seems to be a little soft. Good composition and exposure, although I think it may be better to see it either with more or less depth of field.</td>', 'The focus seems to be on the top petals that received the light and the lower petal with the water drop(?) seems to be a little soft. Good composition and exposure, although I think it may be better to see it either with more or less depth of field.', '2004-03-24 16:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(636345, 65861, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good composition, especially good negative space for title and blurbs. The lighting is good, as is the color, with the smoke almost acting like a leading line from right to left. If I were to say anything negative it would be maybe wanting the car a ltitle closer and a tad sharper, but it''s fine as is.</td>', 'Good composition, especially good negative space for title and blurbs. The lighting is good, as is the color, with the smoke almost acting like a leading line from right to left. If I were to say anything negative it would be maybe wanting the car a ltitle closer and a tad sharper, but it''s fine as is.', '2004-03-24 16:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(636349, 65776, 16850, '<td valign="top">Too many corks</td>', 'Too many corks', '2004-03-24 16:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(636353, 65851, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good vibrant color on the food, which is always important in cooking magazines.  The background seems a little close (a dof thing that you may or may not have had control over), and the slice of bread also starts to go OOF and blend in with the background. There also seems to be some noise in the salt/pepper that could be either because of the lighting conditions or an increase in saturation. To eliminate the background problem I would have eliminated the background itself, but of course that may not have looked as good either, hard to know unless it''s been tried. A very colorful shot.</td>', 'Good vibrant color on the food, which is always important in cooking magazines.  The background seems a little close (a dof thing that you may or may not have had control over), and the slice of bread also starts to go OOF and blend in with the background. There also seems to be some noise in the salt/pepper that could be either because of the lighting conditions or an increase in saturation. To eliminate the background problem I would have eliminated the background itself, but of course that may not have looked as good either, hard to know unless it''s been tried. A very colorful shot.', '2004-03-24 16:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(636363, 65881, 6008, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice is the landscape orientation, but I''m sure a magazine layout editor could still work with it. You''ve got close, which is good, but in doing so you''ve cropped out parts of the dog that could look odd if the shot isnt full frame like it is now. S/he has something in his/her mouth but you cannot see exactly what and so it becomes more of a distraction. The white on the right hand side looks blown, but part of the nose is dark so there is some uneven exposure. There isnt much to see of the left eye as it falls within the dark area so some dodging in a photo editor may help some.</td>', 'First thing I notice is the landscape orientation, but I''m sure a magazine layout editor could still work with it. You''ve got close, which is good, but in doing so you''ve cropped out parts of the dog that could look odd if the shot isnt full frame like it is now. S/he has something in his/her mouth but you cannot see exactly what and so it becomes more of a distraction. The white on the right hand side looks blown, but part of the nose is dark so there is some uneven exposure. There isnt much to see of the left eye as it falls within the dark area so some dodging in a photo editor may help some.', '2004-03-24 16:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(636383, 65893, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is a classic. The naturally curved  branches, the detail, the tonal range.  The natural pose and ordinariness of the subjects with their matching hats is wonderful, this looks like a shot where every detail was planed and set to enhance and highlight every other aspect of the shot.  The couple ooze a mature emotion/connection to each other and the world around them.  Perfectly executed , wonderful work.</td>', 'This is a classic. The naturally curved  branches, the detail, the tonal range.  The natural pose and ordinariness of the subjects with their matching hats is wonderful, this looks like a shot where every detail was planed and set to enhance and highlight every other aspect of the shot.  The couple ooze a mature emotion/connection to each other and the world around them.  Perfectly executed , wonderful work.', '2004-03-24 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(636386, 65867, 7969, '<td valign="top">You have captured that deranged model/sultry innocence mag cover look very well with this image.   good use of black and white tones.</td>', 'You have captured that deranged model/sultry innocence mag cover look very well with this image.   good use of black and white tones.', '2004-03-24 16:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(636394, 65904, 18908, '<td valign="top">Humorous</td>', 'Humorous', '2004-03-24 16:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(636398, 65805, 18908, '<td valign="top">looks more like a personal add than a magazine cover....</td>', 'looks more like a personal add than a magazine cover....', '2004-03-24 16:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(636399, 65760, 18908, '<td valign="top">very humorous!</td>', 'very humorous!', '2004-03-24 16:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(636405, 65377, 18908, '<td valign="top">ok....ew</td>', 'ok....ew', '2004-03-24 17:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(636434, 65866, 15982, '<td valign="top">this is such an incredible shot!<br/>the feet are a little odd, but only catch my attention after studying the picture long enough - maybe could have been blurred more to detract my attention from them. They almost look fake. But I still gladly give you a 9!</td>', 'this is such an incredible shot!the feet are a little odd, but only catch my attention after studying the picture long enough - maybe could have been blurred more to detract my attention from them. They almost look fake. But I still gladly give you a 9!', '2004-03-24 17:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(636448, 65864, 15982, '<td valign="top">i wonder how many people are picking at you because it is "out of focus?" Really nice, I hope it does well. 8</td>', 'i wonder how many people are picking at you because it is "out of focus?" Really nice, I hope it does well. 8', '2004-03-24 17:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(636453, 65776, 15982, '<td valign="top">i feel like this could have been a little brighter. but i still think that it is a nice shot. good composition.</td>', 'i feel like this could have been a little brighter. but i still think that it is a nice shot. good composition.', '2004-03-24 17:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(636462, 65546, 15982, '<td valign="top">Really cool picture - i much prefer the candids over the studio shots. but i would like it more if the background were blurred more to remove it from my attention. maybe could have used a warmer color filter to equalize the ''cold'' feeling i get from the overall color because it doesn''t really much what i get from the picture. just my opinion though. good luck!  :)</td>', 'Really cool picture - i much prefer the candids over the studio shots. but i would like it more if the background were blurred more to remove it from my attention. maybe could have used a warmer color filter to equalize the ''cold'' feeling i get from the overall color because it doesn''t really much what i get from the picture. just my opinion though. good luck!  :)', '2004-03-24 17:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(636471, 65859, 15982, '<td valign="top">i think this could have been much brighter and could use some green in the background to contrast with the neutral color of the car. it would make it more powerful to me, anyway. great car though - looks like it is in great shape!</td>', 'i think this could have been much brighter and could use some green in the background to contrast with the neutral color of the car. it would make it more powerful to me, anyway. great car though - looks like it is in great shape!', '2004-03-24 17:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(636477, 65616, 15982, '<td valign="top">I feel like the trees could have used a little more detail along with the rocks - espcially the ones up close. beautiful scenery though! good luck!</td>', 'I feel like the trees could have used a little more detail along with the rocks - espcially the ones up close. beautiful scenery though! good luck!', '2004-03-24 17:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(636488, 65659, 15982, '<td valign="top">I have a little scene just like this enclosed in glass. I kind of think if the subject was completely black it would almost look like an ink drawing - or color paints. I feel you should have burned the glare on the top left of the large building though. good composition.</td>', 'I have a little scene just like this enclosed in glass. I kind of think if the subject was completely black it would almost look like an ink drawing - or color paints. I feel you should have burned the glare on the top left of the large building though. good composition.', '2004-03-24 17:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(636498, 65264, 15982, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been more striking or powerful if you had a warm pin light illuminating the figurine and casting shadows down the curves. maybe could have been cropped a little on the right side so it wasn''t so centered. this would add more interest to the figurine in my opinion. good luck!</td>', 'i think this would have been more striking or powerful if you had a warm pin light illuminating the figurine and casting shadows down the curves. maybe could have been cropped a little on the right side so it wasn''t so centered. this would add more interest to the figurine in my opinion. good luck!', '2004-03-24 17:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(636513, 65877, 15982, '<td valign="top">I have began to take pictures of people finally, and I have found the that the best way to get a really good shot is to catch them when they are oblivious to you/the camera''s presence. i.e. catch him as he is putting on the pack, or starting to walk off. a color filter would also provide a more interesting light to add more content to the picture. Hope you guys enjoyed the backpacking trip!!! I just got back from a week long excursion through the mountains!<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I have began to take pictures of people finally, and I have found the that the best way to get a really good shot is to catch them when they are oblivious to you/the camera''s presence. i.e. catch him as he is putting on the pack, or starting to walk off. a color filter would also provide a more interesting light to add more content to the picture. Hope you guys enjoyed the backpacking trip!!! I just got back from a week long excursion through the mountains!Good luck!', '2004-03-24 17:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(636530, 65881, 15982, '<td valign="top">I hope who ever the boxer puppy''s owner is knows what they are getting into!! I have a brindle female (6yrs) and she was quite the handful in her puppy days. So much training!!! Good luck!<br/> <br/>If you have Photoshop or another post-editing program I would suggest playing with the levels and colors to bring out the puppy more. He/she blends in to the background so much. I would say use a better light source, but I know it is impossible to get a boxer puppy where you want them and to stay long enough to take the picture!!!</td>', 'I hope who ever the boxer puppy''s owner is knows what they are getting into!! I have a brindle female (6yrs) and she was quite the handful in her puppy days. So much training!!! Good luck! If you have Photoshop or another post-editing program I would suggest playing with the levels and colors to bring out the puppy more. He/she blends in to the background so much. I would say use a better light source, but I know it is impossible to get a boxer puppy where you want them and to stay long enough to take the picture!!!', '2004-03-24 17:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(636577, 65863, 15810, '<td valign="top">stunning, beautiful shot. Sounds like a dull magazine but a absolutely brilliant cover. 10</td>', 'stunning, beautiful shot. Sounds like a dull magazine but a absolutely brilliant cover. 10', '2004-03-24 18:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(636609, 65866, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is a great looking lil kid, she looks spunky and  cool,  it is a great shot, fun perspective. One of my top 10 for this challenge. well done.</td>', 'This is a great looking lil kid, she looks spunky and  cool,  it is a great shot, fun perspective. One of my top 10 for this challenge. well done.', '2004-03-24 18:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(636655, 65622, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice dof and pov. I don''t know, but I think that a more colorful background would have added some more punch to this. But what can you do? You gotta take them where they are. I might have cropped out whatever that is up in the top left.</td>', 'Nice dof and pov. I don''t know, but I think that a more colorful background would have added some more punch to this. But what can you do? You gotta take them where they are. I might have cropped out whatever that is up in the top left.', '2004-03-24 18:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(636674, 65866, 11800, '<td valign="top">Technically very good. Nice even lighting. That''s some serious red on her head. Beautiful. Expressive face. I might have tucked the hand on the right under her arm also to hide the nails and also to give a stronger vision of rebellion.</td>', 'Technically very good. Nice even lighting. That''s some serious red on her head. Beautiful. Expressive face. I might have tucked the hand on the right under her arm also to hide the nails and also to give a stronger vision of rebellion.', '2004-03-24 18:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(636713, 65866, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is so appropriate for the magazine.  Love the the perspective and the DOF.  Just needs space for the title.  But it''s a ten!</td>', 'This is so appropriate for the magazine.  Love the the perspective and the DOF.  Just needs space for the title.  But it''s a ten!', '2004-03-24 18:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(636718, 65561, 12962, '<td valign="top">The clarity and DOF is remarkable.  Background is appropriate.  The diagonal composition is very pleasing.  Could have had a whole body exposure but not much is lost even without the tail.  Space for the title is more than enough.  A ten!</td>', 'The clarity and DOF is remarkable.  Background is appropriate.  The diagonal composition is very pleasing.  Could have had a whole body exposure but not much is lost even without the tail.  Space for the title is more than enough.  A ten!', '2004-03-24 18:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
