(636788, 65725, 2333, '<td valign="top">Great capture! the PS''d in background blur looks very unnatural however. The blur shows around the disc &amp; dog, and the blur is constant even under the dog where it shold be in focus.</td>', 'Great capture! the PS''d in background blur looks very unnatural however. The blur shows around the disc & dog, and the blur is constant even under the dog where it shold be in focus.', '2004-03-24 19:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(636814, 65603, 2333, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, love the crazy reflection. Needs an off-center horizon, and just a little interest in the background, e.g. an OOF beach umbrella.<br/>Colors are flat &amp; drab, needs to be "punched up" by increasing contrast, pulling in black point,  increasing saturation slightly &amp; getting rid of the yellow cast.</td>', 'Like the idea, love the crazy reflection. Needs an off-center horizon, and just a little interest in the background, e.g. an OOF beach umbrella.Colors are flat & drab, needs to be "punched up" by increasing contrast, pulling in black point,  increasing saturation slightly & getting rid of the yellow cast.', '2004-03-24 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(636830, 65884, 2333, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, very nice light. You left the proper space for title &amp; text. Your image contains alot of detail that could be brought out with a bit more careful sharpening. Also, the background is hazy, a common occurence. Since this is advinced editing, take advantage and select jjust the distant area and use a "clarifying" technique, e.g USM at a radius of 30, amount 30%, threshold 0.</td>', 'Like the composition, very nice light. You left the proper space for title & text. Your image contains alot of detail that could be brought out with a bit more careful sharpening. Also, the background is hazy, a common occurence. Since this is advinced editing, take advantage and select jjust the distant area and use a "clarifying" technique, e.g USM at a radius of 30, amount 30%, threshold 0.', '2004-03-24 19:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(636843, 65700, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very much like the compostion. The top looks very artificially darkened, and IMO this detracts.<br/>Just a touch more contrast in the foregound, and maybe a touch more saturation there would help to bring out the beautiful golden tones in the plants, and emphasize the contrast with the muted blue &amp; gray of the distant peak.</td>', 'Very much like the compostion. The top looks very artificially darkened, and IMO this detracts.Just a touch more contrast in the foregound, and maybe a touch more saturation there would help to bring out the beautiful golden tones in the plants, and emphasize the contrast with the muted blue & gray of the distant peak.', '2004-03-24 20:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(636859, 65339, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting &amp; composition, and I absolutely love the use of PS (or equivalent) to give it a painted look. Very natural, not overdone. Kudos.</td>', 'Very nice lighting & composition, and I absolutely love the use of PS (or equivalent) to give it a painted look. Very natural, not overdone. Kudos.', '2004-03-24 20:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
