(637200, 65826, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The two dominant red blocks help anchor the shot and the horizontal sign adds some zing to it. It looks a little soft, but that could be because of the resizing.  I would have cropped out the part of the building in the background with the writting on it because the half letters distract from the composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The two dominant red blocks help anchor the shot and the horizontal sign adds some zing to it. It looks a little soft, but that could be because of the resizing.  I would have cropped out the part of the building in the background with the writting on it because the half letters distract from the composition.', '2004-03-25 00:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(637212, 65905, 11800, '<td valign="top">The model looks relaxed and competent at the activity she is engaged in. The pov really works nicely. I think I would have used a little less dof to make the model more of the focus of the picture. If she is a friend, you might reshoot this with the sun hitting her from the back and with more distance between you and her. That way you could get all the rod and line in the picture. I think fly fishing pictures are great just because of the interesting pattern the line makes.</td>', 'The model looks relaxed and competent at the activity she is engaged in. The pov really works nicely. I think I would have used a little less dof to make the model more of the focus of the picture. If she is a friend, you might reshoot this with the sun hitting her from the back and with more distance between you and her. That way you could get all the rod and line in the picture. I think fly fishing pictures are great just because of the interesting pattern the line makes.', '2004-03-25 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(637407, 65893, 1024, '<td valign="top">The human element makes this a very powerful photograph.</td>', 'The human element makes this a very powerful photograph.', '2004-03-25 05:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(637411, 65725, 1024, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing, perfect catch. DOF is great, no distracting elements. 10</td>', 'Perfect timing, perfect catch. DOF is great, no distracting elements. 10', '2004-03-25 05:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(637415, 65863, 1024, '<td valign="top">I do not know where to begin to tell you how much I love this photograph.  The atmosphere is wonderful, spooky, surreal.  The composition is perfect, espeially the line of light poles down the right side, giving a frame to the rest of the hoto.  The colors are bright enough where they need to be, but muted enough to give a haunting feel.  great job, and good luck.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I do not know where to begin to tell you how much I love this photograph.  The atmosphere is wonderful, spooky, surreal.  The composition is perfect, espeially the line of light poles down the right side, giving a frame to the rest of the hoto.  The colors are bright enough where they need to be, but muted enough to give a haunting feel.  great job, and good luck. ', '2004-03-25 05:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(637417, 65907, 1024, '<td valign="top">You have capture the true feeling of the islands.  How I wish I was there.</td>', 'You have capture the true feeling of the islands.  How I wish I was there.', '2004-03-25 05:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(637419, 65700, 1024, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.  Your DOF is perfect and you caputed the proper exposure, not easy in a scene like this.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.  Your DOF is perfect and you caputed the proper exposure, not easy in a scene like this.', '2004-03-25 05:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(637437, 65474, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good portrait of the dog with all the tonal range captured. With all that snow(?) on him/her, it might have been fun to show a little of the surroundings.</td>', 'Good portrait of the dog with all the tonal range captured. With all that snow(?) on him/her, it might have been fun to show a little of the surroundings.', '2004-03-25 06:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(637444, 65602, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice picture. I like all the whiteness and the way the front bird looks like it''s protecting the others. However, I don''t think these birds would end up on the cover of OP. Not that it will change your score, you just picked the wrong mag to represent the picture. I subscribe to OP.</td>', 'This is a really nice picture. I like all the whiteness and the way the front bird looks like it''s protecting the others. However, I don''t think these birds would end up on the cover of OP. Not that it will change your score, you just picked the wrong mag to represent the picture. I subscribe to OP.', '2004-03-25 06:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(637478, 65891, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Intelligent space left for magazine title and features text. Makes mw want to go trekking.</td>', 'Great shot, Intelligent space left for magazine title and features text. Makes mw want to go trekking.', '2004-03-25 07:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(637479, 65668, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, goos use of negatice space for titles etc just lacking that crisp focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, goos use of negatice space for titles etc just lacking that crisp focus.', '2004-03-25 07:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
