(637845, 65603, 15982, '<td valign="top">I think the overall gloominess of the picture detracts from what I get from you intent. When I think of Nickelodeon or cartoons, I think of childhood/happiness/bright. The background really clashes with this emotion. If it would have been blue skies with some white puffy clouds thrown in, I think it would be a much stronger picture. The composition is really good and I really like the idea though. Maybe could have tweaked the levels a little to bring out more color on SpongeBob as well. Good luck!</td>', 'I think the overall gloominess of the picture detracts from what I get from you intent. When I think of Nickelodeon or cartoons, I think of childhood/happiness/bright. The background really clashes with this emotion. If it would have been blue skies with some white puffy clouds thrown in, I think it would be a much stronger picture. The composition is really good and I really like the idea though. Maybe could have tweaked the levels a little to bring out more color on SpongeBob as well. Good luck!', '2004-03-25 11:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
