(638285, 65904, 11897, '<td valign="top">should have saved this for the orange challenge :)<br/>fine sharp picture.</td>', 'should have saved this for the orange challenge :)fine sharp picture.', '2004-03-25 15:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(638286, 65590, 11897, '<td valign="top">good capture.</td>', 'good capture.', '2004-03-25 15:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(638289, 65634, 11897, '<td valign="top">well taken.</td>', 'well taken.', '2004-03-25 15:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(638292, 65546, 11897, '<td valign="top">Great shot, would be improved by turning more to your left to avoid the posts.</td>', 'Great shot, would be improved by turning more to your left to avoid the posts.', '2004-03-25 15:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(638293, 65663, 11897, '<td valign="top">good overall picture.</td>', 'good overall picture.', '2004-03-25 15:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(638294, 65926, 11897, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-03-25 15:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(638295, 65700, 11897, '<td valign="top">Stunning picture, good luck.</td>', 'Stunning picture, good luck.', '2004-03-25 15:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(638296, 65124, 11897, '<td valign="top">This will make a great print.</td>', 'This will make a great print.', '2004-03-25 15:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(638297, 65656, 11897, '<td valign="top">I recognise this, taken just as well, love the crispness and focus.</td>', 'I recognise this, taken just as well, love the crispness and focus.', '2004-03-25 15:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(638299, 65885, 11897, '<td valign="top">I think you will get some critics saying get rid of the tree. lovely picture.</td>', 'I think you will get some critics saying get rid of the tree. lovely picture.', '2004-03-25 15:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(638301, 65822, 11897, '<td valign="top">well composed shot.</td>', 'well composed shot.', '2004-03-25 15:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(638305, 65893, 18552, '<td valign="top">I really like your picture. I think it might have been better in color.</td>', 'I really like your picture. I think it might have been better in color.', '2004-03-25 15:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(638306, 65833, 11897, '<td valign="top">Love the background, good shot.</td>', 'Love the background, good shot.', '2004-03-25 15:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(638312, 65668, 18552, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you''ve set up this still life. However, the picture itself would be better if the focus were improved and the lighting.  The angle of the lighting is unflattering to the subject and casts unflattering shadows in the picture.</td>', 'I really like the way you''ve set up this still life. However, the picture itself would be better if the focus were improved and the lighting.  The angle of the lighting is unflattering to the subject and casts unflattering shadows in the picture.', '2004-03-25 15:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(638315, 65466, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a very clever idea for a picture. I think it would be a bit better if the thong (or flip flop) were in better focus and the angle of the shot was higher so the thong wouldn''t look so huge. At first I had a hard time figuring out what it was.</td>', 'This is a very clever idea for a picture. I think it would be a bit better if the thong (or flip flop) were in better focus and the angle of the shot was higher so the thong wouldn''t look so huge. At first I had a hard time figuring out what it was.', '2004-03-25 15:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(638319, 65656, 18552, '<td valign="top">Another very pleasing pasta picture. However, I don''t think it would appear on the cover of a magazine called Easy Home Cooking - such a magazine would probably always have a picture of a something already cooked and ready to serve. I love cooking magazines and always look at them.</td>', 'Another very pleasing pasta picture. However, I don''t think it would appear on the cover of a magazine called Easy Home Cooking - such a magazine would probably always have a picture of a something already cooked and ready to serve. I love cooking magazines and always look at them.', '2004-03-25 15:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(638325, 65884, 318, '<td valign="top">Is that a path?</td>', 'Is that a path?', '2004-03-25 15:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(638566, 65834, 18485, '<td valign="top">i went to the eye magazine website to check out the appropriateness of your excellent entry--pretty cool periodical and wonderful site.  your photo, as gorgeous as it is is almost too conventional for it!!  anyway, you have a beauty here.  great work amazing dof, great light.</td>', 'i went to the eye magazine website to check out the appropriateness of your excellent entry--pretty cool periodical and wonderful site.  your photo, as gorgeous as it is is almost too conventional for it!!  anyway, you have a beauty here.  great work amazing dof, great light.', '2004-03-25 17:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(638570, 65856, 18485, '<td valign="top">one of the best of the big bird shots.  nice work.</td>', 'one of the best of the big bird shots.  nice work.', '2004-03-25 17:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(638573, 65777, 18485, '<td valign="top">too grainy for top scores.  cool shot though.</td>', 'too grainy for top scores.  cool shot though.', '2004-03-25 17:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(638576, 65833, 18485, '<td valign="top">i LIKE the offset position of this great subject.  of course, i take mine with a lemon twist, if you please!  lovely entry!  (and to be picayune...the glass should be a little frostier.)</td>', 'i LIKE the offset position of this great subject.  of course, i take mine with a lemon twist, if you please!  lovely entry!  (and to be picayune...the glass should be a little frostier.)', '2004-03-25 17:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(638579, 65916, 18485, '<td valign="top">to dark for fashion.  nice portrait tho''</td>', 'to dark for fashion.  nice portrait tho''', '2004-03-25 17:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(638615, 65460, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good use of top-left to bottom-right diagonal. Very effective use of limited depth of field. However, the shot is very noisy, I would have cleaned this up with NeatImage. IMO the flower needs much more sharpening in PS. I think your thick black border detracts from your photo. Your camera needs a bit of help in PS with colours and saturation... the colours seem a bit dull and lifeless.</td>', 'Very nice shot, good use of top-left to bottom-right diagonal. Very effective use of limited depth of field. However, the shot is very noisy, I would have cleaned this up with NeatImage. IMO the flower needs much more sharpening in PS. I think your thick black border detracts from your photo. Your camera needs a bit of help in PS with colours and saturation... the colours seem a bit dull and lifeless.', '2004-03-25 17:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(638620, 65601, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, although I would have been tempted to flip it horizontaly... I prefer the top-left to bottom-right diagonal. Great colours, and nice use of limited DOF. Personally I think there''s just a little too much going on in the foreground... the composition would work better if there was more overall simplicity in the white elements.</td>', 'Nice composition, although I would have been tempted to flip it horizontaly... I prefer the top-left to bottom-right diagonal. Great colours, and nice use of limited DOF. Personally I think there''s just a little too much going on in the foreground... the composition would work better if there was more overall simplicity in the white elements.', '2004-03-25 17:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(638623, 65906, 8522, '<td valign="top">Humourous shot, although this looks too much like a snapshot for it to be effective as a magazine cover. Because you are using average metering with a bright background, the picture is underexposed. You should have exposed for the dog''s coat.</td>', 'Humourous shot, although this looks too much like a snapshot for it to be effective as a magazine cover. Because you are using average metering with a bright background, the picture is underexposed. You should have exposed for the dog''s coat.', '2004-03-25 17:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(638637, 65660, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, but this seems to be typed words on some paper.  If they are those little magnets, there isn''t a way for me to tell because the lighting is so flat.  The spots all over could have been cloned out for the challenge, unless you are making some statement about how love is dirty business. Sorry to sound so negative.  A major headache with digital photos is all the dust on the sensor.  OK, maybe you are saying love is pure and lust is dirty, but there has to be a better way to get the point across.  <br/>Sorta like one of those ink blot tests? I''m beginning to like this one. Will come back to see the comments.</td>', 'I don''t know, but this seems to be typed words on some paper.  If they are those little magnets, there isn''t a way for me to tell because the lighting is so flat.  The spots all over could have been cloned out for the challenge, unless you are making some statement about how love is dirty business. Sorry to sound so negative.  A major headache with digital photos is all the dust on the sensor.  OK, maybe you are saying love is pure and lust is dirty, but there has to be a better way to get the point across.  Sorta like one of those ink blot tests? I''m beginning to like this one. Will come back to see the comments.', '2004-03-25 17:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(638639, 65820, 8522, '<td valign="top">Converging verticals are a problem here, fortunately this can now be corrected with the new rules as far as I''m aware. The overal shot is almost pretty good, but making all the elements of the building parallel would make it much more professional. Snow is tricky to expose for, and the building is underexposed. IMO the picture would be much better without the road in the foreground. I know that you can use the empty sky to place text and such into for your magazine cover, but as a photo I would have liked some texture in there, for example some clouds. I love the jagged path in this composition.</td>', 'Converging verticals are a problem here, fortunately this can now be corrected with the new rules as far as I''m aware. The overal shot is almost pretty good, but making all the elements of the building parallel would make it much more professional. Snow is tricky to expose for, and the building is underexposed. IMO the picture would be much better without the road in the foreground. I know that you can use the empty sky to place text and such into for your magazine cover, but as a photo I would have liked some texture in there, for example some clouds. I love the jagged path in this composition.', '2004-03-25 17:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(638643, 65474, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some nice textures in here, it''s a shame it''s underexposed. The part of the photo that should draw the viewer''s eye in any shot of an animal is where the eyes are, and here that doesn''t happen. It doesn''t help that your model has lighter parts of his/her coat just above the eyes that draw attention away, so you need to be quite inventive with your composition to counteract this. Also, the eyes are just too dark with very little shadow detail. The crop doesn''t quite work for me.</td>', 'Some nice textures in here, it''s a shame it''s underexposed. The part of the photo that should draw the viewer''s eye in any shot of an animal is where the eyes are, and here that doesn''t happen. It doesn''t help that your model has lighter parts of his/her coat just above the eyes that draw attention away, so you need to be quite inventive with your composition to counteract this. Also, the eyes are just too dark with very little shadow detail. The crop doesn''t quite work for me.', '2004-03-25 17:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(638645, 65833, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice. The green really makes the blue stand out. The glass candy doesn''t seem to go with the edgy mood of the rest of the photo, imo. Good control of the reflections.</td>', 'The colors are nice. The green really makes the blue stand out. The glass candy doesn''t seem to go with the edgy mood of the rest of the photo, imo. Good control of the reflections.', '2004-03-25 17:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(638654, 65761, 8522, '<td valign="top">This photo does very little for me. The house has been placed unimaginatively right in the centre of the frame, but just off enough for this to look haphazard. The house blends in the background too much, and there is not enough sharpness in the shot. My main gripe is that this is a shot that looks like anyone could have taken it. Look for unusual angles and textures. How could you simplify the composition here? There is simply too much going on in this shot that looks like it hasn''t been thought about. What makes this house special? What can lift this shot out of the ordinary?</td>', 'This photo does very little for me. The house has been placed unimaginatively right in the centre of the frame, but just off enough for this to look haphazard. The house blends in the background too much, and there is not enough sharpness in the shot. My main gripe is that this is a shot that looks like anyone could have taken it. Look for unusual angles and textures. How could you simplify the composition here? There is simply too much going on in this shot that looks like it hasn''t been thought about. What makes this house special? What can lift this shot out of the ordinary?', '2004-03-25 18:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(638658, 65849, 4338, '<td valign="top">nice colors and a great building</td>', 'nice colors and a great building', '2004-03-25 18:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(638661, 65927, 11800, '<td valign="top">This has a warm feeling to it. It''s almost as if the faucet had a  personality and was shyly hiding behind the leaves. I think it might be even better with a bit more of the faucet in focus, but I certainly think it one of the best I''ve voted on so far just the way it is.</td>', 'This has a warm feeling to it. It''s almost as if the faucet had a  personality and was shyly hiding behind the leaves. I think it might be even better with a bit more of the faucet in focus, but I certainly think it one of the best I''ve voted on so far just the way it is.', '2004-03-25 18:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(638664, 65668, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but a few things let this down. The picture must be sharp and in focus! The reflections on the bottle and glasses are distracting. The lighting needs to be much softer, the shadows look unintentional and too sharp. There are burnt out highlights on your candles. It''s a shame about the marks on your background. Your tablecloth doesn''t quite work for me, as it looks like you''ve gone for a symmetrical composition but not quite managed it. I would have taken this shot with the wine and cheese taking up more of the shot. Basicallly lighting is everything in a shot like this, and it looks like you haven''t thought about it enough. Have you tried with several lamps, most or all of them diffused in one way or another? A tripod is a must as well. If your camera allows it, extend your dof.</td>', 'Nice composition, but a few things let this down. The picture must be sharp and in focus! The reflections on the bottle and glasses are distracting. The lighting needs to be much softer, the shadows look unintentional and too sharp. There are burnt out highlights on your candles. It''s a shame about the marks on your background. Your tablecloth doesn''t quite work for me, as it looks like you''ve gone for a symmetrical composition but not quite managed it. I would have taken this shot with the wine and cheese taking up more of the shot. Basicallly lighting is everything in a shot like this, and it looks like you haven''t thought about it enough. Have you tried with several lamps, most or all of them diffused in one way or another? A tripod is a must as well. If your camera allows it, extend your dof.', '2004-03-25 18:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(638676, 65602, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I really like the bird in the foreground. The composition of the birds in the background doesn''t quite do it for me, especially the one that almost looks like it''s resting on the main bird''s head but I realise that a better opportunity may not have existed. There are some great textures in the snow caused by their footprints. It''s a shame about the gunk on the lens.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I really like the bird in the foreground. The composition of the birds in the background doesn''t quite do it for me, especially the one that almost looks like it''s resting on the main bird''s head but I realise that a better opportunity may not have existed. There are some great textures in the snow caused by their footprints. It''s a shame about the gunk on the lens.', '2004-03-25 18:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(638683, 65700, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture and the walkway is inviting but having someone in the picture would have been even more so.</td>', 'Pretty picture and the walkway is inviting but having someone in the picture would have been even more so.', '2004-03-25 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(638694, 65835, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice, if somewhat unimaginative macro. The composition doesn''t quite work for me, it looks like you have cropped it so there is the same amount of space on the left of the flower as the right. This places the centre of the flower in an awkward position within the frame. The purple border really puts me off. The background is a bit dull and chaotic, not really bringing anything to the composition.</td>', 'Nice, if somewhat unimaginative macro. The composition doesn''t quite work for me, it looks like you have cropped it so there is the same amount of space on the left of the flower as the right. This places the centre of the flower in an awkward position within the frame. The purple border really puts me off. The background is a bit dull and chaotic, not really bringing anything to the composition.', '2004-03-25 18:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(638700, 65663, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well taken. The motion blur of the left hand makes me really appreciate the sharp focus of his face and torso. Great expression of concentration captured. It''s a shame the background doesn''t work so well. No shapes there help with your composition, and it looks a bit mundane. The dof works well though.</td>', 'Nice shot, well taken. The motion blur of the left hand makes me really appreciate the sharp focus of his face and torso. Great expression of concentration captured. It''s a shame the background doesn''t work so well. No shapes there help with your composition, and it looks a bit mundane. The dof works well though.', '2004-03-25 18:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(638710, 65693, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures, I especially like the way you''ve exposed this sky. Impressive range of tones captured here. Centred horizons don''t normally look too good, but this works well here, and makes the composition look quite imaginative. The tree on the right makes a great sillhouette.</td>', 'Wonderful textures, I especially like the way you''ve exposed this sky. Impressive range of tones captured here. Centred horizons don''t normally look too good, but this works well here, and makes the composition look quite imaginative. The tree on the right makes a great sillhouette.', '2004-03-25 18:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(638725, 65585, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely cat, almost a great picture but let down by some overexposure on the fur, and an annoying green distraction in the background. The background in general seems random and takes away from the possible impact of this shot.</td>', 'Lovely cat, almost a great picture but let down by some overexposure on the fur, and an annoying green distraction in the background. The background in general seems random and takes away from the possible impact of this shot.', '2004-03-25 18:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(638735, 65696, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great cat photo, the lighting is possibly just a tad too harsh, and I would have liked to see more dof... his/her nose is a little too much out of focus. There is a strange blur around their left ear. Other than that, I love the mood and character of this shot.</td>', 'Great cat photo, the lighting is possibly just a tad too harsh, and I would have liked to see more dof... his/her nose is a little too much out of focus. There is a strange blur around their left ear. Other than that, I love the mood and character of this shot.', '2004-03-25 18:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(638739, 65459, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice shot. Great variety of colours, excellent background. Imaginative composition. The butterfly is an interesting and effective subject. I love the textures here.</td>', 'Wow, very nice shot. Great variety of colours, excellent background. Imaginative composition. The butterfly is an interesting and effective subject. I love the textures here.', '2004-03-25 18:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(638741, 65799, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, interesting foreground... good use of dof. Compositionally quite imaginative. I really don''t like your background though which is too similar in colour to your bird. There is too much texture in your background which takes the attention away from the bird.</td>', 'Nice subject, interesting foreground... good use of dof. Compositionally quite imaginative. I really don''t like your background though which is too similar in colour to your bird. There is too much texture in your background which takes the attention away from the bird.', '2004-03-25 18:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(638746, 65452, 8522, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a little odd here, some strange shadows are on the wall. I''m trying to find any element of beauty in this shot but can''t quite find it. Compositionally seems a little awkward.</td>', 'The lighting looks a little odd here, some strange shadows are on the wall. I''m trying to find any element of beauty in this shot but can''t quite find it. Compositionally seems a little awkward.', '2004-03-25 18:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(638752, 65822, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, the distortion caused by the wide angle lens works dramatically here. Impressive sharpness. Great camera angle. Exposed well. Interesting subject. I don''t like the border, but I won''t allow that to influence my voting here.</td>', 'Very nice picture, the distortion caused by the wide angle lens works dramatically here. Impressive sharpness. Great camera angle. Exposed well. Interesting subject. I don''t like the border, but I won''t allow that to influence my voting here.', '2004-03-25 18:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(638756, 65546, 8522, '<td valign="top">Captured at a good moment, but I''d have liked to see a slower shutter speed to blur the other players and give an impression of speed and movement. The background really takes away from the impact of this shot.</td>', 'Captured at a good moment, but I''d have liked to see a slower shutter speed to blur the other players and give an impression of speed and movement. The background really takes away from the impact of this shot.', '2004-03-25 18:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(638760, 65761, 9763, '<td valign="top">The photo is not completely clear, and the color is a bit washed.  I''d consider it at sunset or add more contrast :)</td>', 'The photo is not completely clear, and the color is a bit washed.  I''d consider it at sunset or add more contrast :)', '2004-03-25 18:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(638761, 65561, 18983, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-03-25 18:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(638762, 65826, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The colors could be more vibrant though (contrast).  I live 1 mile from here!!!  The cropping is a bit tight on the left (or try to cut out the words all together for st. vincent)</td>', 'Great photo.  The colors could be more vibrant though (contrast).  I live 1 mile from here!!!  The cropping is a bit tight on the left (or try to cut out the words all together for st. vincent)', '2004-03-25 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(638763, 65765, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition!  I''d like to see more dark levels, but the photo is great!  8</td>', 'Beautiful composition!  I''d like to see more dark levels, but the photo is great!  8', '2004-03-25 18:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(638766, 65434, 9763, '<td valign="top">I think this would look nice with a diffuser filter or the fountain doing something a little nicer (if it changes sprout styles).  I like the composition</td>', 'I think this would look nice with a diffuser filter or the fountain doing something a little nicer (if it changes sprout styles).  I like the composition', '2004-03-25 18:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(638767, 65575, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and clarity.  The colors are nice too.  I''d use photoshop on the dog''s tongue a bit to remove the shadow and saliva bubbles.  Other than that, the photo is great.  8</td>', 'Very nice composition and clarity.  The colors are nice too.  I''d use photoshop on the dog''s tongue a bit to remove the shadow and saliva bubbles.  Other than that, the photo is great.  8', '2004-03-25 18:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(638768, 65756, 10149, '<td valign="top">border is to big, 6</td>', 'border is to big, 6', '2004-03-25 19:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(638770, 65397, 9763, '<td valign="top">Way too much contrast!  This photo has nice colors, but the composition could be a little nicer (move the gondola to the right a little and up.).</td>', 'Way too much contrast!  This photo has nice colors, but the composition could be a little nicer (move the gondola to the right a little and up.).', '2004-03-25 19:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(638772, 65127, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  The color and lighting are nice, a little bright... but fine.  The motion of the bee is neat too.  I love hte composition and DOF of the flowers.</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  The color and lighting are nice, a little bright... but fine.  The motion of the bee is neat too.  I love hte composition and DOF of the flowers.', '2004-03-25 19:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(638773, 65142, 9763, '<td valign="top">How much of this is photo vs how much is photoshop?  I like the idea, but more for an art contest and photo contest.  The tones are very nice.</td>', 'How much of this is photo vs how much is photoshop?  I like the idea, but more for an art contest and photo contest.  The tones are very nice.', '2004-03-25 19:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(638774, 65739, 9763, '<td valign="top">The car is nice, but the background should not be in focus, in my opinion.  The glare should be toned down a bit too with a polarizer.</td>', 'The car is nice, but the background should not be in focus, in my opinion.  The glare should be toned down a bit too with a polarizer.', '2004-03-25 19:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(638778, 65474, 9763, '<td valign="top">Cropped too tight.  The snow is fun, but the grey day makes the photo a little dull for color, when the color would pop on a blue-sky day.  I know you can''t control that.  But you could try a bit of color level adjustments in photoshop maybe.  Cute dog.</td>', 'Cropped too tight.  The snow is fun, but the grey day makes the photo a little dull for color, when the color would pop on a blue-sky day.  I know you can''t control that.  But you could try a bit of color level adjustments in photoshop maybe.  Cute dog.', '2004-03-25 19:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(638779, 65603, 9763, '<td valign="top">The grey really takes away from the bright fun spongebob.  I would have taken this on a brighter day or used a fake water pool at home with a blue backdrop.</td>', 'The grey really takes away from the bright fun spongebob.  I would have taken this on a brighter day or used a fake water pool at home with a blue backdrop.', '2004-03-25 19:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(638781, 65636, 9763, '<td valign="top">The dark spot in the upper left corner is distracting, also the bridge or rail is not level.  I love the colors though!</td>', 'The dark spot in the upper left corner is distracting, also the bridge or rail is not level.  I love the colors though!', '2004-03-25 19:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(638783, 65696, 9763, '<td valign="top">Tone down your flash a little with the flash exposure compensation.  The eyes are beautiful and the composition is very nice too!  The flash is way too bright though for the fur... too reflective.  I have the same colored cat, i always have to tone down my flash for her.</td>', 'Tone down your flash a little with the flash exposure compensation.  The eyes are beautiful and the composition is very nice too!  The flash is way too bright though for the fur... too reflective.  I have the same colored cat, i always have to tone down my flash for her.', '2004-03-25 19:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(638785, 65124, 9763, '<td valign="top">The photo is amazing for composition, but too bright.  I''d love to see darker blues in the sky and less light on the ducks.  Great shot though!</td>', 'The photo is amazing for composition, but too bright.  I''d love to see darker blues in the sky and less light on the ducks.  Great shot though!', '2004-03-25 19:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(638786, 65595, 9763, '<td valign="top">The composition is ver nice, but the food is not clear...</td>', 'The composition is ver nice, but the food is not clear...', '2004-03-25 19:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(638788, 65460, 9763, '<td valign="top">A little too bright on the lighting, very nice composition</td>', 'A little too bright on the lighting, very nice composition', '2004-03-25 19:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(638790, 65568, 9763, '<td valign="top">I''d have used a more "appetizing" border for thyme.  Like a thin white or yellow line.  The red is not helping the photo.  Also, no need for such a small DOF i think.</td>', 'I''d have used a more "appetizing" border for thyme.  Like a thin white or yellow line.  The red is not helping the photo.  Also, no need for such a small DOF i think.', '2004-03-25 19:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(638800, 65395, 10402, '<td valign="top">Striking orchids. I wish the lips were in focus as well as (or instead of) the petals.</td>', 'Striking orchids. I wish the lips were in focus as well as (or instead of) the petals.', '2004-03-25 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(638809, 65803, 6667, '<td valign="top">Little more to the left and you would have a higher score from me. Great shot  Awesome plane. Good luck</td>', 'Little more to the left and you would have a higher score from me. Great shot  Awesome plane. Good luck', '2004-03-25 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(638813, 65655, 18985, '<td valign="top">camera shake and the composition is ordinary!</td>', 'camera shake and the composition is ordinary!', '2004-03-25 19:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(638814, 65824, 11977, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, very nicely done... love the variegated background.</td>', 'Clever idea, very nicely done... love the variegated background.', '2004-03-25 19:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(638816, 65826, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great combination of repetitions and contrasts. I like the composition. It''s a bit soft; making it sharper would make it catch the eye better.</td>', 'Great combination of repetitions and contrasts. I like the composition. It''s a bit soft; making it sharper would make it catch the eye better.', '2004-03-25 19:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(638819, 65561, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very clear crisp shot.  If it had the entire body (with the full  tail), it would have faired very high from me.  It appears you compromised the shot and sacrificed in favor of the precision close up. . . or this is all you got and went with it. In short - it''s cut off.  Still, nicely done. Good luck.</td>', 'Very clear crisp shot.  If it had the entire body (with the full  tail), it would have faired very high from me.  It appears you compromised the shot and sacrificed in favor of the precision close up. . . or this is all you got and went with it. In short - it''s cut off.  Still, nicely done. Good luck.', '2004-03-25 19:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(638822, 65566, 10402, '<td valign="top">The sepia color is great, and there is a nice variety of interesting shapes and textures.</td>', 'The sepia color is great, and there is a nice variety of interesting shapes and textures.', '2004-03-25 19:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(638823, 65648, 6667, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I got one of these guys in my front yard. Nice capture.  I don''t know how many shots I''ve taken of mine without even the hint of this quality.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hey!  I got one of these guys in my front yard. Nice capture.  I don''t know how many shots I''ve taken of mine without even the hint of this quality.  Good luck.', '2004-03-25 19:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(638826, 65456, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the depth of field is too narrow. The center of interest is the nostril, and it should be in focus, as well as the feathers with their fascinating texture.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the depth of field is too narrow. The center of interest is the nostril, and it should be in focus, as well as the feathers with their fascinating texture.', '2004-03-25 19:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(638830, 65124, 10402, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity. Nice capture of the shapes, forms, and textures here. Unique point of view as well.</td>', 'Wonderful clarity. Nice capture of the shapes, forms, and textures here. Unique point of view as well.', '2004-03-25 19:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(638846, 65339, 2158, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether you deliberately went for an arty look of if this just comes from over-compression, but it looks good.</td>', 'I don''t know whether you deliberately went for an arty look of if this just comes from over-compression, but it looks good.', '2004-03-25 19:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(638849, 65891, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nicely captures the subject, but there is nothing to make the photo special.</td>', 'Nicely captures the subject, but there is nothing to make the photo special.', '2004-03-25 19:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(638859, 65927, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great approach; this is a very interesting photo of a rather mundane subject.</td>', 'Great approach; this is a very interesting photo of a rather mundane subject.', '2004-03-25 20:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(638871, 65676, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The island has an interesting shape and a nice variety of textures. It''s a bit washed out; a polarizer may have helped when taking the photo, but adjusting levels would improve it some. And some sharpening would bring out the nice textures.</td>', 'Great composition. The island has an interesting shape and a nice variety of textures. It''s a bit washed out; a polarizer may have helped when taking the photo, but adjusting levels would improve it some. And some sharpening would bring out the nice textures.', '2004-03-25 20:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(638875, 65605, 10402, '<td valign="top">Blurry and just not very interesting.</td>', 'Blurry and just not very interesting.', '2004-03-25 20:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(638883, 65856, 10848, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot, Very graceful. Wonderful clarity and focus.Great job 9</td>', 'Gorgeous shot, Very graceful. Wonderful clarity and focus.Great job 9', '2004-03-25 20:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(638886, 65601, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I have a picture similar to this on my profile page. I am from the south too and this is a beautiful time of year for photos. Wonderful angle, and the blue sky background really adds contrast to this shot 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I have a picture similar to this on my profile page. I am from the south too and this is a beautiful time of year for photos. Wonderful angle, and the blue sky background really adds contrast to this shot 10', '2004-03-25 20:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(638891, 65700, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding, this shot is amazing. Wonderful angle in which to shoot this shot, the upward slope to the mountains background is outstanding I like this very much..can you tell? :) 10</td>', 'Outstanding, this shot is amazing. Wonderful angle in which to shoot this shot, the upward slope to the mountains background is outstanding I like this very much..can you tell? :) 10', '2004-03-25 20:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(638915, 65574, 10402, '<td valign="top">Lacks contrast, but great subject and composition</td>', 'Lacks contrast, but great subject and composition', '2004-03-25 20:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(638950, 65401, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a great action shot! I think it would be even better if the focus was a little better and the contrast was increased a bit.</td>', 'What a great action shot! I think it would be even better if the focus was a little better and the contrast was increased a bit.', '2004-03-25 21:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(638953, 65595, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is really nice, the composition is great and so are the colors. I think it would be a bit better if the focus was crisper. I''m also not really sure that the flowers up in the corner really add to the shot. They kind of look like they are hanging in mid air.</td>', 'Your picture is really nice, the composition is great and so are the colors. I think it would be a bit better if the focus was crisper. I''m also not really sure that the flowers up in the corner really add to the shot. They kind of look like they are hanging in mid air.', '2004-03-25 21:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(638954, 65456, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is really nice. The only improvements I could suggest would be to have the beak in focus and perhaps not crop it quite so closely.</td>', 'Your picture is really nice. The only improvements I could suggest would be to have the beak in focus and perhaps not crop it quite so closely.', '2004-03-25 21:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(638957, 65655, 1054, '<td valign="top">One of the better entries, but it would be improved with a shorter DOF to better set the President off from the people behind him.</td>', 'One of the better entries, but it would be improved with a shorter DOF to better set the President off from the people behind him.', '2004-03-25 21:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(638958, 65601, 1054, '<td valign="top">Well done... the DOF and placement make this perfect for a magazine cover. Interesting photo in its own right, too.</td>', 'Well done... the DOF and placement make this perfect for a magazine cover. Interesting photo in its own right, too.', '2004-03-25 21:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(638961, 65568, 1054, '<td valign="top">*groan*</td>', '*groan*', '2004-03-25 21:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(638999, 65867, 11977, '<td valign="top">This is just a great job.. wonderful light, lovely model with an interesting pose, great comp.  I see  a couple small areas with halos (left side shoulder and hair in the middle of her face) but otherwise perfect.</td>', 'This is just a great job.. wonderful light, lovely model with an interesting pose, great comp.  I see  a couple small areas with halos (left side shoulder and hair in the middle of her face) but otherwise perfect.', '2004-03-25 22:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(639020, 65459, 17203, '<td valign="top">It''d be tough to add type around all the contrasting shapes, but the color, focus and exposure are quite good. The composition might be improved by cropping the neighboring petal off the left side. This would have likely scored higher in the Orange challenge!</td>', 'It''d be tough to add type around all the contrasting shapes, but the color, focus and exposure are quite good. The composition might be improved by cropping the neighboring petal off the left side. This would have likely scored higher in the Orange challenge!', '2004-03-25 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(639024, 65142, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good concept and plenty of room for type, although the exaggerated horizontal layout should test voters'' perception of a magazine cover. The effects are cool, but end up looking far more like an illustration than a photo.</td>', 'Good concept and plenty of room for type, although the exaggerated horizontal layout should test voters'' perception of a magazine cover. The effects are cool, but end up looking far more like an illustration than a photo.', '2004-03-25 22:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(639029, 65720, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yep, I could picture this on a cover, and plenty o'' room for type, too. Nice job on the snowy exposure. I''d like to see that tree on the right cropped off, though.</td>', 'Yep, I could picture this on a cover, and plenty o'' room for type, too. Nice job on the snowy exposure. I''d like to see that tree on the right cropped off, though.', '2004-03-25 22:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(639030, 65569, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Yachts of luck!</td>', 'Nicely done. Yachts of luck!', '2004-03-25 22:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(639033, 65568, 17203, '<td valign="top">Now that''s funny! You might have gotten considerably higher votes with a title like, "Mad Magazine- the cover of Thyme," becuase this clearly wouldn''t be used on a mainstream publication.</td>', 'Now that''s funny! You might have gotten considerably higher votes with a title like, "Mad Magazine- the cover of Thyme," becuase this clearly wouldn''t be used on a mainstream publication.', '2004-03-25 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(639037, 65849, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cool architecture and quite clean for a night shot. You''d score higher with most voters by cropping more off the right and extending the black top &amp; bottom for a vertical format. What''s in the foreground? Looks almost like hooded Franciscan monks  ;-)</td>', 'Cool architecture and quite clean for a night shot. You''d score higher with most voters by cropping more off the right and extending the black top & bottom for a vertical format. What''s in the foreground? Looks almost like hooded Franciscan monks  ;-)', '2004-03-25 22:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(639047, 65654, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ah, Nebraska artillery. Nice exposure, dynamic composition and no question where the type goes. This shot would benefit from a nice sunset or puffy white clouds, but those can be tough props to find. Looks like you found a use for a Parallel Lines outtake, too  ;-)</td>', 'Ah, Nebraska artillery. Nice exposure, dynamic composition and no question where the type goes. This shot would benefit from a nice sunset or puffy white clouds, but those can be tough props to find. Looks like you found a use for a Parallel Lines outtake, too  ;-)', '2004-03-25 22:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(639058, 65663, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good shot for a magazine and nice DOF. Did you try cropping off-center? That might help to suggest  movement and make the image more dynamic.</td>', 'Good shot for a magazine and nice DOF. Did you try cropping off-center? That might help to suggest  movement and make the image more dynamic.', '2004-03-25 23:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(639067, 65549, 17203, '<td valign="top">Clever, and you obviously went to a lot of trouble. Unfortunately, I don''t think this shot could, in turn, be effectively used as a magazine cover photo, and the cheap printed pen didn''t help. Sorry!</td>', 'Clever, and you obviously went to a lot of trouble. Unfortunately, I don''t think this shot could, in turn, be effectively used as a magazine cover photo, and the cheap printed pen didn''t help. Sorry!', '2004-03-25 23:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(639090, 65737, 17203, '<td valign="top">This looks like the handiwork of librodo (and that''s a compliment). Beautiful in color, content and technique. I''ll assume the headline runs down the side of the photo and not across her face. Even with that, I''d still like to see more space around her head. Well done!</td>', 'This looks like the handiwork of librodo (and that''s a compliment). Beautiful in color, content and technique. I''ll assume the headline runs down the side of the photo and not across her face. Even with that, I''d still like to see more space around her head. Well done!', '2004-03-25 23:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(639092, 65603, 18991, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!</td>', 'Awesome!!', '2004-03-25 23:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(639097, 65911, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and I like the ''halo'' at the top of the lighthouse. Plenty of room for type, too. Unfortunately, the building is very dark, but not enough to be an intentional silhouette. I''ll bet the shot would have scored 1.5 points higher by darkening the sky and dodging the building in Photoshop.</td>', 'Nice composition, and I like the ''halo'' at the top of the lighthouse. Plenty of room for type, too. Unfortunately, the building is very dark, but not enough to be an intentional silhouette. I''ll bet the shot would have scored 1.5 points higher by darkening the sky and dodging the building in Photoshop.', '2004-03-25 23:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(639103, 65408, 17203, '<td valign="top">Judging by the crowds, this could be the LA Clippers fan club magazine. A cool photo, but too busy for a magazine cover. It would be tough to read any type on the top 2/3 of the shot. You''d have scored near the top in Design &amp; Engineering with this, though.</td>', 'Judging by the crowds, this could be the LA Clippers fan club magazine. A cool photo, but too busy for a magazine cover. It would be tough to read any type on the top 2/3 of the shot. You''d have scored near the top in Design & Engineering with this, though.', '2004-03-25 23:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(639109, 65660, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... not much of a photo I''m afraid. While the image might be appropriate for this magazine, it''s unlikely that any designer would hire a photographer to shoot something so easily rendered by computer. Now print those same words on acetate and shoot them over an interesting background and you might have a winner.</td>', 'Hmm... not much of a photo I''m afraid. While the image might be appropriate for this magazine, it''s unlikely that any designer would hire a photographer to shoot something so easily rendered by computer. Now print those same words on acetate and shoot them over an interesting background and you might have a winner.', '2004-03-25 23:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(639120, 65842, 17203, '<td valign="top">A good image, though not particularly compelling to me personally. I think the shot would have turned out much better if you set the exposure on the bright sky, then used fill flash to light the subject. You''d have captured tone in the sky and the background trees wouldn''t be breaking up. Also, a plain (or less contrasty) blanket would allow more opportunities for reading type over the photo.</td>', 'A good image, though not particularly compelling to me personally. I think the shot would have turned out much better if you set the exposure on the bright sky, then used fill flash to light the subject. You''d have captured tone in the sky and the background trees wouldn''t be breaking up. Also, a plain (or less contrasty) blanket would allow more opportunities for reading type over the photo.', '2004-03-25 23:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(639124, 65465, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and crisp focus. Very impactful- and I like the generally diagonal feel of the composition. For the purposes of this challenge, note that Flower &amp; Garden runs their headline from edge to edge right at the top of the magazine, so you should have left more room along the top and ditched the border. (No, I''m not going to beat you up for that).</td>', 'Beautiful colors and crisp focus. Very impactful- and I like the generally diagonal feel of the composition. For the purposes of this challenge, note that Flower & Garden runs their headline from edge to edge right at the top of the magazine, so you should have left more room along the top and ditched the border. (No, I''m not going to beat you up for that).', '2004-03-25 23:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(639142, 65909, 17203, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, with good composition and crisp focus. As a photographer, you should note that Flora Garten is a vertical format, and that it could be difficult to read type over an image with this much contrast. I do like the shot, though. I''ll bet you could get a stunning cover photo with a really tight crop of the main flower that fills the entire page.</td>', 'A very nice photo, with good composition and crisp focus. As a photographer, you should note that Flora Garten is a vertical format, and that it could be difficult to read type over an image with this much contrast. I do like the shot, though. I''ll bet you could get a stunning cover photo with a really tight crop of the main flower that fills the entire page.', '2004-03-26 00:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(639147, 65655, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really good...I do wish the face was a little more in focus.</td>', 'This is really good...I do wish the face was a little more in focus.', '2004-03-26 00:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(639148, 65826, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like this street scene.  I like the vertical lines of the two main signs, like the repetitive LA''s, nice building detail, and I even like the arrows.  I think you had a good eye for this one.</td>', 'I like this street scene.  I like the vertical lines of the two main signs, like the repetitive LA''s, nice building detail, and I even like the arrows.  I think you had a good eye for this one.', '2004-03-26 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(639153, 65866, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Perfect face for it with the red hair. blue eyes and freckles!   I like the attitude she shows and I like the angle.  Only thing I think might make it better would be lieaving a little more space at the top.  Great job.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Perfect face for it with the red hair. blue eyes and freckles!   I like the attitude she shows and I like the angle.  Only thing I think might make it better would be lieaving a little more space at the top.  Great job.', '2004-03-26 00:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(639155, 65725, 17203, '<td valign="top">A very cool shot. I do wish the dog was a bit lower on the page, though. Also, it''s obvious that the blur was created in Photoshop. Nice job on a difficult mask, but the blur effect is plainly visible around the frisbee and legs. Use the cloning tools or history brush to remove that glow and no one will ever know. Good luck!</td>', 'A very cool shot. I do wish the dog was a bit lower on the page, though. Also, it''s obvious that the blur was created in Photoshop. Nice job on a difficult mask, but the blur effect is plainly visible around the frisbee and legs. Use the cloning tools or history brush to remove that glow and no one will ever know. Good luck!', '2004-03-26 00:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(639160, 65901, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very nice choice of tones for this shot.  I could see this on a magazine cover.</td>', 'Very nice choice of tones for this shot.  I could see this on a magazine cover.', '2004-03-26 00:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(639161, 65927, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.  I think it needs a little more "pop" to the colors and the focus to really make it work.</td>', 'I like this idea.  I think it needs a little more "pop" to the colors and the focus to really make it work.', '2004-03-26 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(639162, 65605, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... the crocus is the focus- the dog isn''t even paying attention. Sort of like shooting the back of my kid''s head for Parents magazine. Pet photos CAN do well here, but you''d need an amazing pose, or dramatic lighting or at least a closeup of the dog''s face to succeed.</td>', 'Hmm... the crocus is the focus- the dog isn''t even paying attention. Sort of like shooting the back of my kid''s head for Parents magazine. Pet photos CAN do well here, but you''d need an amazing pose, or dramatic lighting or at least a closeup of the dog''s face to succeed.', '2004-03-26 00:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(639163, 65601, 14986, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.   Wonderful colors, composition and DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful.   Wonderful colors, composition and DOF.', '2004-03-26 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(639166, 65776, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice idea.  I''m not sure what happened to your border on the left.  I think it looks rather odd cut off like it is.  I also think the picture would be better with some wine in the goblet.    Still, a nice shot.</td>', 'This is a very nice idea.  I''m not sure what happened to your border on the left.  I think it looks rather odd cut off like it is.  I also think the picture would be better with some wine in the goblet.    Still, a nice shot.', '2004-03-26 00:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(639168, 65596, 14986, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and presentation here I think.  Unique shot.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and presentation here I think.  Unique shot.', '2004-03-26 00:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(639170, 65875, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the hummer!  I would have liked it better cropping out the very front flowers.  I think they are so large and out of focus that they are a distraction to the rest of the photo, which is very nice.</td>', 'Nice capture of the hummer!  I would have liked it better cropping out the very front flowers.  I think they are so large and out of focus that they are a distraction to the rest of the photo, which is very nice.', '2004-03-26 00:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(639171, 65289, 14986, '<td valign="top">What lovely colors.  It looks like a water color painting.</td>', 'What lovely colors.  It looks like a water color painting.', '2004-03-26 00:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(639173, 65648, 14986, '<td valign="top">I not a big bird photo fan, but I really like this one and can easily see it as a magazine cover.  Very nice detail and colors.</td>', 'I not a big bird photo fan, but I really like this one and can easily see it as a magazine cover.  Very nice detail and colors.', '2004-03-26 00:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(639174, 65749, 14986, '<td valign="top">Wow...great color.</td>', 'Wow...great color.', '2004-03-26 00:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(639176, 65656, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hey... didn''t I just see this in Parallel Lines? Yes, it probably would make a decent magazine cover and I do like it. The three small pieces of pasta look out of place to me (another challenge!)- what recipe would call for just 3 bites? Two of them almost form a right angle following the edges of the page- not quite straight, but also not off enough to be random. It would have been cool to see either several types of pasta or a few strands of spinach linguine (or other color).</td>', 'Hey... didn''t I just see this in Parallel Lines? Yes, it probably would make a decent magazine cover and I do like it. The three small pieces of pasta look out of place to me (another challenge!)- what recipe would call for just 3 bites? Two of them almost form a right angle following the edges of the page- not quite straight, but also not off enough to be random. It would have been cool to see either several types of pasta or a few strands of spinach linguine (or other color).', '2004-03-26 00:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(639177, 65264, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the potential here.  I''m not sure how...but I''d like to see better lighting on the figure.</td>', 'I like the potential here.  I''m not sure how...but I''d like to see better lighting on the figure.', '2004-03-26 00:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(639179, 65401, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  I really like the snow flying to give the action to the photo.</td>', 'This is very good.  I really like the snow flying to give the action to the photo.', '2004-03-26 00:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(639181, 65663, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice, clear photo.  It seems a bit out of place to me that on the front of a runner''s magazine that you can''t see any of the legs of the runner.  I think I would like it better pulled away a bit to see the legs.</td>', 'This is a very nice, clear photo.  It seems a bit out of place to me that on the front of a runner''s magazine that you can''t see any of the legs of the runner.  I think I would like it better pulled away a bit to see the legs.', '2004-03-26 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(639182, 65761, 14986, '<td valign="top">Neat looking place.  I would have cropped out about half of that drive and I would have tilited the photo a bit to the right, which I think would straighten up the house some.  Hmm...then maybe the tree would be "off".   I can envision this on the cover.</td>', 'Neat looking place.  I would have cropped out about half of that drive and I would have tilited the photo a bit to the right, which I think would straighten up the house some.  Hmm...then maybe the tree would be "off".   I can envision this on the cover.', '2004-03-26 00:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(639184, 65851, 14986, '<td valign="top">This sure makes me hungry!   This is a wonderful food shot that could easitly be on the cover of a magazine.  Great focus, lighting and color.  I like the set up a lot.</td>', 'This sure makes me hungry!   This is a wonderful food shot that could easitly be on the cover of a magazine.  Great focus, lighting and color.  I like the set up a lot.', '2004-03-26 00:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(639187, 65822, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific shot.  The location and background have great lines but are not distracting.  Her stance and expression are serious and match well with the subject.  Lighting and focus are perfect.   This will be a ribbon winner I predict!</td>', 'This is a terrific shot.  The location and background have great lines but are not distracting.  Her stance and expression are serious and match well with the subject.  Lighting and focus are perfect.   This will be a ribbon winner I predict!', '2004-03-26 00:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(639191, 65590, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great action pic. I''m not familiar with the mag, but I think it could work.</td>', 'Great action pic. I''m not familiar with the mag, but I think it could work.', '2004-03-26 00:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(639192, 65907, 2667, '<td valign="top">For me, this image nails the challenge better than most. Nicely done.</td>', 'For me, this image nails the challenge better than most. Nicely done.', '2004-03-26 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(639193, 65889, 2667, '<td valign="top">I like the limited DOF, and the framing works well. Would make a nice cover, I think.</td>', 'I like the limited DOF, and the framing works well. Would make a nice cover, I think.', '2004-03-26 00:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(639194, 65648, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great capture. With a bit more space at the top, a bit less at the bottom, I think it would make a nice cover.</td>', 'Great capture. With a bit more space at the top, a bit less at the bottom, I think it would make a nice cover.', '2004-03-26 00:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(639195, 65696, 2667, '<td valign="top">Crisp clean image. Cropped a bit differently it would be quite suitable for the mag, I think. Nicely done.</td>', 'Crisp clean image. Cropped a bit differently it would be quite suitable for the mag, I think. Nicely done.', '2004-03-26 00:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(639196, 65864, 2667, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this image. The lines are nice and clean, no clutter, and the composition would work well for a mag cover, I think. If anything, I think it needs a bit more space at the top, a bit less at the bottom.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this image. The lines are nice and clean, no clutter, and the composition would work well for a mag cover, I think. If anything, I think it needs a bit more space at the top, a bit less at the bottom.', '2004-03-26 00:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(639197, 65901, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like the sepia toning. I could see on the cover of such a mag.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like the sepia toning. I could see on the cover of such a mag.', '2004-03-26 00:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(639199, 65824, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I love the simplicity. But I do think one of the more important compositional elements (the cutouts) would get lost in the title.</td>', 'Great idea. I love the simplicity. But I do think one of the more important compositional elements (the cutouts) would get lost in the title.', '2004-03-26 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(639214, 65824, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is very nice!  I like the green tones to it.  The shadows and lighting are great.</td>', 'This is very nice!  I like the green tones to it.  The shadows and lighting are great.', '2004-03-26 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(639226, 65568, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  Points for originality!</td>', 'Very clever.  Points for originality!', '2004-03-26 01:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(639229, 65459, 14986, '<td valign="top">This would have been wonderful for the orange challenge!</td>', 'This would have been wonderful for the orange challenge!', '2004-03-26 01:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(639234, 65700, 12160, '<td valign="top">amazing shot. 10</td>', 'amazing shot. 10', '2004-03-26 01:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(639242, 65465, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful details on the flowers. very nice image! 8</td>', 'beautiful details on the flowers. very nice image! 8', '2004-03-26 02:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(639244, 65806, 12160, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image. One way to work around water reflections is to use a polarizing filter. This will prevent or minimize blown out hightlights. 6</td>', 'Not a bad image. One way to work around water reflections is to use a polarizing filter. This will prevent or minimize blown out hightlights. 6', '2004-03-26 02:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(639246, 65561, 12160, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. nice composition/exposure. Nothing that I can see that needs improvement. 10</td>', 'Beautiful image. nice composition/exposure. Nothing that I can see that needs improvement. 10', '2004-03-26 02:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(639265, 65799, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is a colorful photo with an interesting subject. To me, it seems the blur has been added in post processing and for some reason, it takes away from the quality of the picture. It looks as if there was a lot of sharpening done around the bird or maybe the mask that was used wasn''t feathered enough? I use the eraser tool when doing masks to get more control over the edges.</td>', 'This is a colorful photo with an interesting subject. To me, it seems the blur has been added in post processing and for some reason, it takes away from the quality of the picture. It looks as if there was a lot of sharpening done around the bird or maybe the mask that was used wasn''t feathered enough? I use the eraser tool when doing masks to get more control over the edges.', '2004-03-26 03:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(639268, 65142, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The profile and smoke are very graphic and are enhanced by the crop. The added flames on the head take away from the impact. Good choice of using the negative filter. Did you try cropping down to just above and behind his eye?  I like it a lot but feel it was mistreated during the post processing stage.</td>', 'Interesting. The profile and smoke are very graphic and are enhanced by the crop. The added flames on the head take away from the impact. Good choice of using the negative filter. Did you try cropping down to just above and behind his eye?  I like it a lot but feel it was mistreated during the post processing stage.', '2004-03-26 03:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(639271, 65890, 11800, '<td valign="top">I get a feeling of designed chaos from this picture. All the textures and shapes are great. At first, I didn''t like how the post processing flatened out all the details, but as I have looked, I can see how they add to the purely graphic presentation. I think a  stark contrast would make this more graphic.</td>', 'I get a feeling of designed chaos from this picture. All the textures and shapes are great. At first, I didn''t like how the post processing flatened out all the details, but as I have looked, I can see how they add to the purely graphic presentation. I think a  stark contrast would make this more graphic.', '2004-03-26 03:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(639275, 65870, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy. The framing is good as well as the exposure. The one in the back is a bit distracting because of the brightness. I think it would have been less distracting if it had been darkened up a little.</td>', 'Cute little guy. The framing is good as well as the exposure. The one in the back is a bit distracting because of the brightness. I think it would have been less distracting if it had been darkened up a little.', '2004-03-26 03:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(639288, 65896, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very unique take on the focus. That does separate this from most of the other flower shots. Bold. The colors are a little weak. Did you try adjusting the saturation?</td>', 'Very unique take on the focus. That does separate this from most of the other flower shots. Bold. The colors are a little weak. Did you try adjusting the saturation?', '2004-03-26 03:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(639291, 65866, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The pose and expression you have captured is very natural. The only part which distracts me somewhat is the top right hand area of the hair, there seem to be some irregularities there.</td>', 'I like this one. The pose and expression you have captured is very natural. The only part which distracts me somewhat is the top right hand area of the hair, there seem to be some irregularities there.', '2004-03-26 04:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(639292, 65702, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice clear focus, perfect dof, good color.</td>', 'Nice clear focus, perfect dof, good color.', '2004-03-26 04:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(639294, 65490, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good picture that really captures the meaning of the magazine.  I think the space at the top was left on purpose, but it seems that everything is scrunched to the bottom and makes it look unbalanced.</td>', 'Good picture that really captures the meaning of the magazine.  I think the space at the top was left on purpose, but it seems that everything is scrunched to the bottom and makes it look unbalanced.', '2004-03-26 04:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(639396, 65663, 16636, '<td valign="top">Well composed action shot, fits all criteria very well for this challenge IMO - 7</td>', 'Well composed action shot, fits all criteria very well for this challenge IMO - 7', '2004-03-26 07:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(639397, 65803, 16636, '<td valign="top">Well composed shot, fits all criteria very well for this challenge IMO - 7</td>', 'Well composed shot, fits all criteria very well for this challenge IMO - 7', '2004-03-26 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(639398, 65546, 16636, '<td valign="top">Well composed action shot, fits all criteria very well for this challenge IMO - 7</td>', 'Well composed action shot, fits all criteria very well for this challenge IMO - 7', '2004-03-26 07:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(639399, 65866, 16636, '<td valign="top">I can relate to this photo - Well composed shot, fits all criteria very well for this challenge IMO - 8</td>', 'I can relate to this photo - Well composed shot, fits all criteria very well for this challenge IMO - 8', '2004-03-26 07:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
