(639724, 65209, 12733, '<td valign="top">He does look fierce. Nice shot, and it fits the magazine format; that is, vertical. It could use a little dead space at the top or along the right to give the designer someplace to put the type.</td>', 'He does look fierce. Nice shot, and it fits the magazine format; that is, vertical. It could use a little dead space at the top or along the right to give the designer someplace to put the type.', '2004-03-26 12:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
