(639732, 65875, 12733, '<td valign="top">This would be a great shot if not for the out of focus flowers at the bottom. It still is a really nice shot.</td>', 'This would be a great shot if not for the out of focus flowers at the bottom. It still is a really nice shot.', '2004-03-26 12:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
