(639750, 65702, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and a good magazine cover, with a vertical format and space at the top that could carry type without spoiling the picture. I really like the expression on the bird''s face.</td>', 'Nice shot, and a good magazine cover, with a vertical format and space at the top that could carry type without spoiling the picture. I really like the expression on the bird''s face.', '2004-03-26 12:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
