(639859, 65776, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great shot. one of my 10s</td>', 'Great shot. one of my 10s', '2004-03-26 13:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(639878, 64921, 4494, '<td valign="top">Good crop.  I know it must have been tempting to make this a "landscape" orientation but that wouldn''t be a mag cover (which are portriat).  Very good.</td>', 'Good crop.  I know it must have been tempting to make this a "landscape" orientation but that wouldn''t be a mag cover (which are portriat).  Very good.', '2004-03-26 14:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(639879, 65884, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  I like how there''s just mountain in the picture with no sky, etc.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  I like how there''s just mountain in the picture with no sky, etc.', '2004-03-26 14:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(639881, 65327, 4494, '<td valign="top">I don''t think many magazine covers would be black and white.</td>', 'I don''t think many magazine covers would be black and white.', '2004-03-26 14:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(639884, 65737, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s awesome.  This would be a fantastic mag cover.  It''s great.  9.</td>', 'Wow that''s awesome.  This would be a fantastic mag cover.  It''s great.  9.', '2004-03-26 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(639886, 65142, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, that''s bizzare.  Having fun with Photoshop I see. :)</td>', 'LOL, that''s bizzare.  Having fun with Photoshop I see. :)', '2004-03-26 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(639892, 65696, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The contrast and lighting, color, focus, everything, looks perfect.  The only "problem" is the front paws are a little obscured but oh well.  Still great.  8.</td>', 'Very nice.  The contrast and lighting, color, focus, everything, looks perfect.  The only "problem" is the front paws are a little obscured but oh well.  Still great.  8.', '2004-03-26 14:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(639897, 65897, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, I really like the colors.  The blue is really cool.  The only thing I don''t like for magazine cover, is the border.  A mag cover wouldn''t have a border like that, although otherwise I like it.</td>', 'Pretty nice, I really like the colors.  The blue is really cool.  The only thing I don''t like for magazine cover, is the border.  A mag cover wouldn''t have a border like that, although otherwise I like it.', '2004-03-26 14:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(639900, 65668, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of the subject elements...  But the background is, well, empty.  You should have put something colorfull behind it.  And I don''t think the soft focus works here.  There should be something that''s in perfect focus.  Lighting is a little weak.</td>', 'Nice composition of the subject elements...  But the background is, well, empty.  You should have put something colorfull behind it.  And I don''t think the soft focus works here.  There should be something that''s in perfect focus.  Lighting is a little weak.', '2004-03-26 14:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(639913, 65765, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, a great high-impact shot. Shame about the shadow under the bonnet. Great colours. Superb feel.</td>', 'Wow, a great high-impact shot. Shame about the shadow under the bonnet. Great colours. Superb feel.', '2004-03-26 14:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(639920, 65896, 8522, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture which has unfortunately had too much soft-focus blur applied.</td>', 'A beautiful picture which has unfortunately had too much soft-focus blur applied.', '2004-03-26 14:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(639924, 65866, 19011, '<td valign="top">This is so true...excellent photo. Gives that real " That parents need help" impression.</td>', 'This is so true...excellent photo. Gives that real " That parents need help" impression.', '2004-03-26 14:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(639930, 65887, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and great DOF.  Perffect placement of bird and tree for the addition of text along top and right margin.  One of my favourites.  Good luck</td>', 'Excellent shot and great DOF.  Perffect placement of bird and tree for the addition of text along top and right margin.  One of my favourites.  Good luck', '2004-03-26 14:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(639933, 65568, 11738, '<td valign="top">Funny, but weak shot.  Like your creativity, though.  Badly lit and a bit too soft as well.  The stems hanging leading out the left side of the frame make this shot distracting.</td>', 'Funny, but weak shot.  Like your creativity, though.  Badly lit and a bit too soft as well.  The stems hanging leading out the left side of the frame make this shot distracting.', '2004-03-26 14:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(639936, 65884, 11738, '<td valign="top">Ummm... where''s da highway.  Nice shot.  Love the light in the foreground.</td>', 'Ummm... where''s da highway.  Nice shot.  Love the light in the foreground.', '2004-03-26 14:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(639939, 64921, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool bird but weird crop, even for a magazine cover.  Love how you stopped the pelican in motion.  The distal feathers are very clear.</td>', 'Cool bird but weird crop, even for a magazine cover.  Love how you stopped the pelican in motion.  The distal feathers are very clear.', '2004-03-26 14:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(639940, 65327, 11738, '<td valign="top">Black and White not the best selection for a front page shot of a floral magazine, no?  Apart from that I like it.  Good job with properly lighting your subject and slightly off center composition works well.</td>', 'Black and White not the best selection for a front page shot of a floral magazine, no?  Apart from that I like it.  Good job with properly lighting your subject and slightly off center composition works well.', '2004-03-26 14:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(639944, 65648, 11738, '<td valign="top">Bird''s head seems slightly out of focus.  Good use of DOF.  I also like how you cropped this image.  Would make pretty good cover photo.</td>', 'Bird''s head seems slightly out of focus.  Good use of DOF.  I also like how you cropped this image.  Would make pretty good cover photo.', '2004-03-26 14:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(639946, 65595, 11738, '<td valign="top">Not quite sharp enough and that bright candletop is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Not quite sharp enough and that bright candletop is a bit distracting.', '2004-03-26 14:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(639947, 65725, 11738, '<td valign="top">Totally awesome!!  Love how you captured the dog in full motion.  DOF is cool too.  Great job on getting this properly focussed: must be SLR camera.  My favourite so far.</td>', 'Totally awesome!!  Love how you captured the dog in full motion.  DOF is cool too.  Great job on getting this properly focussed: must be SLR camera.  My favourite so far.', '2004-03-26 14:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(639948, 65629, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot but could have been run through NeatImage once or twice to reduce all that noise in the sky.</td>', 'Very cool shot but could have been run through NeatImage once or twice to reduce all that noise in the sky.', '2004-03-26 15:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(639949, 65339, 11738, '<td valign="top">Hope you don''t get burned too much for using a "creative" filter.  I like it and I think it could work as a magazine cover.</td>', 'Hope you don''t get burned too much for using a "creative" filter.  I like it and I think it could work as a magazine cover.', '2004-03-26 15:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(639950, 65585, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent kitty shot.</td>', 'Excellent kitty shot.', '2004-03-26 15:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(639955, 65209, 11738, '<td valign="top">Another zoo big kitty shot.  He looks like a sub-adult.  Great capture and the low/flat light works very well here.  Good shallow DOF.  Good work.</td>', 'Another zoo big kitty shot.  He looks like a sub-adult.  Great capture and the low/flat light works very well here.  Good shallow DOF.  Good work.', '2004-03-26 15:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(639958, 65900, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I know I kep giving the same comment, but great DOF.  Awesome timing too to have the ball in the shot.  Photo would have looked kind of goofy without it.  I like the crop with the grass and soil in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I know I kep giving the same comment, but great DOF.  Awesome timing too to have the ball in the shot.  Photo would have looked kind of goofy without it.  I like the crop with the grass and soil in the foreground.', '2004-03-26 15:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(639961, 65867, 11738, '<td valign="top">MMMmmm... wet womaaaan......arrrrrr &lt;drool&gt;.  Super shot.  You have captured one of the sexiest things on earth: a wet woman.  Good use of B&amp;W.  Good luck.  Among my top 5.</td>', 'MMMmmm... wet womaaaan......arrrrrr <drool>.  Super shot.  You have captured one of the sexiest things on earth: a wet woman.  Good use of B&W.  Good luck.  Among my top 5.', '2004-03-26 15:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(639962, 65264, 11738, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, but nice concept.</td>', 'A bit dark, but nice concept.', '2004-03-26 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(639963, 65632, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the solid black background.</td>', 'Too bad about the solid black background.', '2004-03-26 15:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(639967, 65460, 11738, '<td valign="top">I woud have rotated this 90 degrees CW.  Apart from that, excellent capture of a wild orchid.  Crop doesn''t really fit magazine cover either.</td>', 'I woud have rotated this 90 degrees CW.  Apart from that, excellent capture of a wild orchid.  Crop doesn''t really fit magazine cover either.', '2004-03-26 15:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
