(640229, 65838, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good exposure. C&amp;D uses a squre format, so the horizontal orientation isn''t a real problem. You might have done even better with an angled or motion shot- most car mags do this because parked cars tend to look static.</td>', 'Nice shot and good exposure. C&D uses a squre format, so the horizontal orientation isn''t a real problem. You might have done even better with an angled or motion shot- most car mags do this because parked cars tend to look static.', '2004-03-26 18:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(640231, 65860, 17203, '<td valign="top">I have a tough time picturing this on a food magazine cover- it''s all about the net. If it weren''t for the two protruding claws, I would have no idea what was under there. Sorry!</td>', 'I have a tough time picturing this on a food magazine cover- it''s all about the net. If it weren''t for the two protruding claws, I would have no idea what was under there. Sorry!', '2004-03-26 18:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(640234, 65822, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The only significant problem I have with it is that one person isn''t much of a rally- and even that person doesn''t seem to be particularly motivated. The crop just emphasizes how alone she is on this deserted street. Maybe a tighter crop with the model holding the sign up, shouting, etc.?</td>', 'Nice shot. The only significant problem I have with it is that one person isn''t much of a rally- and even that person doesn''t seem to be particularly motivated. The crop just emphasizes how alone she is on this deserted street. Maybe a tighter crop with the model holding the sign up, shouting, etc.?', '2004-03-26 18:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(640237, 65339, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yes, I could easily see this on a magazine cover. The painterly effect is overdone for me, though (this site is, after all, about photography- not painting). The same shot without the effects would probably score much higher (particularly with dramatic lighting).</td>', 'Yes, I could easily see this on a magazine cover. The painterly effect is overdone for me, though (this site is, after all, about photography- not painting). The same shot without the effects would probably score much higher (particularly with dramatic lighting).', '2004-03-26 18:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(640238, 65824, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cool- I like the composition and overall ''money'' color. I hope the props didn''t cost you $100! Maybe you could have shot this reversed (dolls at bottom right and shadow in back)? Half the dolls would lost under the headline here.</td>', 'Cool- I like the composition and overall ''money'' color. I hope the props didn''t cost you $100! Maybe you could have shot this reversed (dolls at bottom right and shadow in back)? Half the dolls would lost under the headline here.', '2004-03-26 19:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(640239, 65777, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ooooh. Good shot and a fine cover. I don''t know if it''s the crop or the camera, but I''d really like to see more detail.</td>', 'Ooooh. Good shot and a fine cover. I don''t know if it''s the crop or the camera, but I''d really like to see more detail.', '2004-03-26 19:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
