(640483, 65702, 17203, '<td valign="top">A common bird, but very well executed shot. If you had captured an Ivory Billed Woodpecker, I''d give you a 10.</td>', 'A common bird, but very well executed shot. If you had captured an Ivory Billed Woodpecker, I''d give you a 10.', '2004-03-26 22:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(640489, 65776, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if that is a picture (on your computer) behind the set up, but it sure does add an interesting depth to this photograph. The lighting is superb. A really classy entry.</td>', 'I don''t know if that is a picture (on your computer) behind the set up, but it sure does add an interesting depth to this photograph. The lighting is superb. A really classy entry.', '2004-03-26 22:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(640491, 65891, 17203, '<td valign="top">A good shot that''s believable as a magazine cover, but not a very exciting destination. Those mags tend to feature the Grand Tetons or other specacular scenery. Maybe if you cropped out the trees to leave more to the imagination?</td>', 'A good shot that''s believable as a magazine cover, but not a very exciting destination. Those mags tend to feature the Grand Tetons or other specacular scenery. Maybe if you cropped out the trees to leave more to the imagination?', '2004-03-26 22:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(640495, 65875, 11800, '<td valign="top">A good clear colorful picture that is sure to catch the attention of the observer and increase sales. I think this is one of the most effective entries into this challenge.</td>', 'A good clear colorful picture that is sure to catch the attention of the observer and increase sales. I think this is one of the most effective entries into this challenge.', '2004-03-26 22:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(640498, 65926, 17203, '<td valign="top">A great scene apparently compromised by fading light. Maybe a flash could have captured some detail in the dog and livened up the foreground? Plenty of room for type. I like the composition, although I''d flip the shot to get the dog more to the right (important for magazines believe it or not).</td>', 'A great scene apparently compromised by fading light. Maybe a flash could have captured some detail in the dog and livened up the foreground? Plenty of room for type. I like the composition, although I''d flip the shot to get the dog more to the right (important for magazines believe it or not).', '2004-03-26 22:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(640501, 65866, 17203, '<td valign="top">That''s some serious color! I think you might have done even better with a brightly-colored shirt and cropping out the feet. Could be a dental publication too- aaaaaahhh!   ;-)</td>', 'That''s some serious color! I think you might have done even better with a brightly-colored shirt and cropping out the feet. Could be a dental publication too- aaaaaahhh!   ;-)', '2004-03-26 22:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(640510, 65739, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good actiion shot, tough background. Ideally, you''d need to shoot down on the car from a higher vantage point for a more neutral background or maybe just from another angle.</td>', 'Good actiion shot, tough background. Ideally, you''d need to shoot down on the car from a higher vantage point for a more neutral background or maybe just from another angle.', '2004-03-26 22:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(640512, 65553, 17203, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm! Good idea. You''d benefit from a warmer light (always helps for baked goods) and maybe a shallow point of view to add depth. OK- now I have to go get a snack...</td>', 'Mmmmm! Good idea. You''d benefit from a warmer light (always helps for baked goods) and maybe a shallow point of view to add depth. OK- now I have to go get a snack...', '2004-03-26 22:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(640513, 65928, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good shot and appropriate for that publication. Looks like the light was starting fade on you. I wish I could see a little more water at the top.</td>', 'Good shot and appropriate for that publication. Looks like the light was starting fade on you. I wish I could see a little more water at the top.', '2004-03-26 22:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(640517, 65668, 9763, '<td valign="top">a bit blurry.  also, try a deep gold on the back wall</td>', 'a bit blurry.  also, try a deep gold on the back wall', '2004-03-26 22:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(640518, 65456, 9763, '<td valign="top">wish the beak was in focus too!</td>', 'wish the beak was in focus too!', '2004-03-26 22:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(640520, 65834, 9763, '<td valign="top">Wish the eyebrow was in focus too!</td>', 'Wish the eyebrow was in focus too!', '2004-03-26 22:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(640521, 65588, 9763, '<td valign="top">not in focus</td>', 'not in focus', '2004-03-26 23:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(640522, 65127, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cute. Not really appropriate for the cover of an entertainment magazine, but cute. Nice to finally see some signs of Spring (not here yet). Composition looks better to me when cropped on both sides.</td>', 'Cute. Not really appropriate for the cover of an entertainment magazine, but cute. Nice to finally see some signs of Spring (not here yet). Composition looks better to me when cropped on both sides.', '2004-03-26 23:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(640523, 65574, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Looks like you were really close! Not enough light to get a good exposure- contrast is pretty flat. Using a higher ISO setting on your camera could have solved that.</td>', 'Nice composition. Looks like you were really close! Not enough light to get a good exposure- contrast is pretty flat. Using a higher ISO setting on your camera could have solved that.', '2004-03-26 23:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(640526, 65820, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good subject &amp; composition. Better weather would be the key thing to improve here. Outside of that, the best you can do is burn the sky &amp; snow and dodge the building in Photoshop to bring out the details</td>', 'Good subject & composition. Better weather would be the key thing to improve here. Outside of that, the best you can do is burn the sky & snow and dodge the building in Photoshop to bring out the details', '2004-03-26 23:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(640529, 65603, 17203, '<td valign="top">Clever- very nicely done.</td>', 'Clever- very nicely done.', '2004-03-26 23:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(640530, 65910, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nice color, composition &amp; exposure. One of the strongest entries this week (and not just because it''s deisel-powered).</td>', 'Beautiful. Nice color, composition & exposure. One of the strongest entries this week (and not just because it''s deisel-powered).', '2004-03-26 23:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(640532, 65916, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Love the eye and hair color. I might have dodged the other eye a bit to bring out some detail. Crop out the white material at bottom to leave more to the imagination.</td>', 'Good composition. Love the eye and hair color. I might have dodged the other eye a bit to bring out some detail. Crop out the white material at bottom to leave more to the imagination.', '2004-03-26 23:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(640535, 65648, 17203, '<td valign="top">This little woodpecker really gets around, doesn''t he? Great detail and lighting- a worthy entry. You might burn in the right side a bit (a little too bright) and dodge the eye and face to bring out detail. I''d like to see the bird less centered, too.</td>', 'This little woodpecker really gets around, doesn''t he? Great detail and lighting- a worthy entry. You might burn in the right side a bit (a little too bright) and dodge the eye and face to bring out detail. I''d like to see the bird less centered, too.', '2004-03-26 23:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(640537, 65456, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Any closer and you''d scratch the lens. The detail is so wonderful that I want to see more of it, so the shallow DOF hurts.</td>', 'Yikes! Any closer and you''d scratch the lens. The detail is so wonderful that I want to see more of it, so the shallow DOF hurts.', '2004-03-26 23:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(640540, 65834, 17203, '<td valign="top">Eye think you have a winner here. One of my favorites. DOF is just a little too shallow (the highlight and edge of the iris), but what a striking cover! 9</td>', 'Eye think you have a winner here. One of my favorites. DOF is just a little too shallow (the highlight and edge of the iris), but what a striking cover! 9', '2004-03-26 23:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(640541, 65561, 17203, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit common for this publication, but a nice shot and dynamic composition. Light is a little flat. Good job with the cropping. THANK YOU for not strapping a fat yellow border around this!</td>', 'Perhaps a bit common for this publication, but a nice shot and dynamic composition. Light is a little flat. Good job with the cropping. THANK YOU for not strapping a fat yellow border around this!', '2004-03-26 23:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(640542, 65636, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice, subtle colors. I like the composition better with the big tree on the left (maybe even the entire left) cropped out. Good job capturing detail in both the bright and dark clouds.</td>', 'Nice, subtle colors. I like the composition better with the big tree on the left (maybe even the entire left) cropped out. Good job capturing detail in both the bright and dark clouds.', '2004-03-26 23:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(640544, 65289, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good macro focus, but too much shade.</td>', 'Good macro focus, but too much shade.', '2004-03-26 23:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(640546, 65596, 17203, '<td valign="top">Funny! "15 Ways to Spruce up a Meal." Would be nicer still with a fancier fork and lower on the page. I''d like to see the fork in perspective to get a better sense of depth (like the pine cones).</td>', 'Funny! "15 Ways to Spruce up a Meal." Would be nicer still with a fancier fork and lower on the page. I''d like to see the fork in perspective to get a better sense of depth (like the pine cones).', '2004-03-26 23:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(640549, 65893, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. I''d like to see more of the sides cropped off. BTW- there''s something a little unsettling about retirees walking into an apparent dead-end. It''s the End of the Road...</td>', 'Very good shot. I''d like to see more of the sides cropped off. BTW- there''s something a little unsettling about retirees walking into an apparent dead-end. It''s the End of the Road...', '2004-03-26 23:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(640550, 65900, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good capture, and a fine layout for a magazine. The ball and foreground have an overprocessed look to them, though.</td>', 'Good capture, and a fine layout for a magazine. The ball and foreground have an overprocessed look to them, though.', '2004-03-26 23:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(640551, 65676, 17203, '<td valign="top">Quite a scene. A little washed out by the distance. I''d love to see this from the side, with the lighthouse framed by the sky.</td>', 'Quite a scene. A little washed out by the distance. I''d love to see this from the side, with the lighthouse framed by the sky.', '2004-03-26 23:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(640554, 65630, 17203, '<td valign="top">Fine Photograph. Among the best of the bunch.  ;-)</td>', 'Fine Photograph. Among the best of the bunch.  ;-)', '2004-03-26 23:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(640557, 65593, 17203, '<td valign="top">Funny capture. It''s a shame the duck and water are both a drab brown. This one might actually benefit from B&amp;W.</td>', 'Funny capture. It''s a shame the duck and water are both a drab brown. This one might actually benefit from B&W.', '2004-03-26 23:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(640562, 65870, 17203, '<td valign="top">This would be stronger with a much tighter crop and no background meerkat. Maybe you could have moved to the left to hide the other guy behind that ''termite mound?''</td>', 'This would be stronger with a much tighter crop and no background meerkat. Maybe you could have moved to the left to hide the other guy behind that ''termite mound?''', '2004-03-26 23:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(640567, 65209, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great subject, lousy light. The overcast light really flattens the contrast and color- perhaps you could have boosted the saturation in Photoshop? I prefer the tree on the right cropped out too (unless the red smudge on the tiger''s chest is the blood of the last guy who criticized this shot, in which case nevermind).  ;-b</td>', 'Great subject, lousy light. The overcast light really flattens the contrast and color- perhaps you could have boosted the saturation in Photoshop? I prefer the tree on the right cropped out too (unless the red smudge on the tiger''s chest is the blood of the last guy who criticized this shot, in which case nevermind).  ;-b', '2004-03-27 00:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(640570, 65776, 17203, '<td valign="top">This would make a great ad for the wine. Love the color (although the background looks too good to be true). The second wine glass is unfortunate, and the primary glass should have some wine in it. Still one of my favorites.</td>', 'This would make a great ad for the wine. Love the color (although the background looks too good to be true). The second wine glass is unfortunate, and the primary glass should have some wine in it. Still one of my favorites.', '2004-03-27 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(640573, 65856, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the best bird shots in the flock. I''d flip the photo so the swan leads the reader into the magazine rather than back toward the spine (a minor point).</td>', 'One of the best bird shots in the flock. I''d flip the photo so the swan leads the reader into the magazine rather than back toward the spine (a minor point).', '2004-03-27 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(640575, 65116, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3 picks. Love the color and cloud detail -reminds me of Gordon''s work (nice!). The purple fringing is unfortunate. Perhaps a higher f-stop might have solved it?</td>', 'One of my top 3 picks. Love the color and cloud detail -reminds me of Gordon''s work (nice!). The purple fringing is unfortunate. Perhaps a higher f-stop might have solved it?', '2004-03-27 00:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(640576, 65907, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3 picks (not saying which). The color looks a little oversaturated, particularly in the bricks. I wanna go... we don''t even have daffodills yet!</td>', 'One of my top 3 picks (not saying which). The color looks a little oversaturated, particularly in the bricks. I wanna go... we don''t even have daffodills yet!', '2004-03-27 00:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(640578, 65700, 17203, '<td valign="top">Only the flat lighting kept this out of my top 3 picks. It''s just a little dreary- one ray of sunlight and you''d have a 10. Beautiful work!</td>', 'Only the flat lighting kept this out of my top 3 picks. It''s just a little dreary- one ray of sunlight and you''d have a 10. Beautiful work!', '2004-03-27 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(640582, 65124, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of my top 5 picks. It looks like an oil painting. Beautiful!</td>', 'One of my top 5 picks. It looks like an oil painting. Beautiful!', '2004-03-27 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(640594, 64921, 19043, '<td valign="top">This one could easily be a cover. The curvature of the feathers, the way your eye leads up to the top wing (just below where the mast would be) and the space at the top and left side all work for a magazine cover. This one''s my pick.</td>', 'This one could easily be a cover. The curvature of the feathers, the way your eye leads up to the top wing (just below where the mast would be) and the space at the top and left side all work for a magazine cover. This one''s my pick.', '2004-03-27 01:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(640652, 65834, 14438, '<td valign="top">Wow ...</td>', 'Wow ...', '2004-03-27 03:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(640822, 65725, 5491, '<td valign="top">"When Photoshop goes wrong..."</td>', '"When Photoshop goes wrong..."', '2004-03-27 11:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(640854, 65916, 5822, '<td valign="top">Posing and coloration are good and composition meets challenge well, but I think you could have gotten better results with some fill light on her right side.</td>', 'Posing and coloration are good and composition meets challenge well, but I think you could have gotten better results with some fill light on her right side.', '2004-03-27 12:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(640871, 65648, 7889, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, dof is excellent as is the colours.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, dof is excellent as is the colours.', '2004-03-27 12:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(640875, 65834, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great image, clarity is excellent, good luck</td>', 'Great image, clarity is excellent, good luck', '2004-03-27 12:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(640876, 65700, 7889, '<td valign="top">Very atsmopheric image, love the colours and the dof is excellent</td>', 'Very atsmopheric image, love the colours and the dof is excellent', '2004-03-27 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(640878, 65590, 7889, '<td valign="top">Angle is excellent, great capture</td>', 'Angle is excellent, great capture', '2004-03-27 12:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(640879, 65818, 7889, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, colours are very good</td>', 'Lovely image, colours are very good', '2004-03-27 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(640880, 65925, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like this very much , hope it does well for you, I would not change anything</td>', 'I like this very much , hope it does well for you, I would not change anything', '2004-03-27 12:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(640882, 65896, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good use of soft focus, lighting is excellent. Very nice photo</td>', 'Good use of soft focus, lighting is excellent. Very nice photo', '2004-03-27 12:23:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(640883, 65737, 7889, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo of a very pretty lady, colour, lightting and dof is spot on.</td>', 'Lovely photo of a very pretty lady, colour, lightting and dof is spot on.', '2004-03-27 12:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(640884, 65456, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great capture</td>', 'Great capture', '2004-03-27 12:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(640886, 65585, 7889, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, background is a little distracting for me</td>', 'Lovely photo, background is a little distracting for me', '2004-03-27 12:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(640887, 65805, 7889, '<td valign="top">Colour is good but the face seems a little out of focus</td>', 'Colour is good but the face seems a little out of focus', '2004-03-27 12:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(640888, 65887, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good capture, nice colour and sharpness</td>', 'Good capture, nice colour and sharpness', '2004-03-27 12:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(640891, 65916, 7889, '<td valign="top">Lighting is excellent, nice photo, dont know what W is but a lot of titles in this challenge dont mean much to me! good luck</td>', 'Lighting is excellent, nice photo, dont know what W is but a lot of titles in this challenge dont mean much to me! good luck', '2004-03-27 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(640893, 65833, 7889, '<td valign="top">Striking picutre, good colours</td>', 'Striking picutre, good colours', '2004-03-27 12:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(640919, 65377, 2609, '<td valign="top">WTF?</td>', 'WTF?', '2004-03-27 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(640922, 65606, 2609, '<td valign="top">I would say that this could be a better photo with a different colored background. Also, did you use that chocolate sauce that you melt in the microwave? It generally looks that course. True dipping chocolate is smoother and I think you could have had a better result.  <br/>The best thing is the composition of the subject. I like that alot.<br/></td>', 'I would say that this could be a better photo with a different colored background. Also, did you use that chocolate sauce that you melt in the microwave? It generally looks that course. True dipping chocolate is smoother and I think you could have had a better result.  The best thing is the composition of the subject. I like that alot.', '2004-03-27 13:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(641015, 65859, 18646, '<td valign="top">I love this photo - the lighting and scenery are perfect.   I like the open sky, which would lend itself nicely to a magazine title.  Lots of room at the bottom too, for text/barcode/etc . . .  great job!</td>', 'I love this photo - the lighting and scenery are perfect.   I like the open sky, which would lend itself nicely to a magazine title.  Lots of room at the bottom too, for text/barcode/etc . . .  great job!', '2004-03-27 16:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(641017, 65602, 16478, '<td valign="top">You probably could have picked a more interesting magazine title, but great photo nonetheless</td>', 'You probably could have picked a more interesting magazine title, but great photo nonetheless', '2004-03-27 16:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(641018, 65377, 16478, '<td valign="top">i''m lost for words...</td>', 'i''m lost for words...', '2004-03-27 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(641019, 65622, 16478, '<td valign="top">Surely that isn''t a real magazine?! Nice photo 7</td>', 'Surely that isn''t a real magazine?! Nice photo 7', '2004-03-27 16:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(641020, 65339, 16478, '<td valign="top">Wow, love the effects you''ve put on this. 8</td>', 'Wow, love the effects you''ve put on this. 8', '2004-03-27 16:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(641023, 65776, 17300, '<td valign="top">Like it, but take away the cork on the bottle.</td>', 'Like it, but take away the cork on the bottle.', '2004-03-27 16:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(641028, 65466, 17300, '<td valign="top">Like the photo, especially with the contrasting red in it... But I don''t think it would up as a cover. 7</td>', 'Like the photo, especially with the contrasting red in it... But I don''t think it would up as a cover. 7', '2004-03-27 16:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(641036, 65805, 17300, '<td valign="top">More space needed above the head. The porportions for a magazine cover are sligthly wrong, thus needing to to crop the photo across the bossom... Which, um, would be a shame.</td>', 'More space needed above the head. The porportions for a magazine cover are sligthly wrong, thus needing to to crop the photo across the bossom... Which, um, would be a shame.', '2004-03-27 17:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(641039, 65116, 17300, '<td valign="top">This is a good one. The only thing I got a problem with is that there is not enough space on the top of the photo, which I guess is needed for the title of the magazine... Give it a 10 anyway</td>', 'This is a good one. The only thing I got a problem with is that there is not enough space on the top of the photo, which I guess is needed for the title of the magazine... Give it a 10 anyway', '2004-03-27 17:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(641045, 65434, 17300, '<td valign="top">Yup, Good cover for architecture magazines... 9</td>', 'Yup, Good cover for architecture magazines... 9', '2004-03-27 17:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(641047, 65723, 17300, '<td valign="top">A little more black space above the head for the magazine titel but I guess in the real world you deal with that in PS. 8</td>', 'A little more black space above the head for the magazine titel but I guess in the real world you deal with that in PS. 8', '2004-03-27 17:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(641051, 65834, 17300, '<td valign="top">Nice one.... Maybe a little too much brush / blur on her eye brow, because the perspective seems wrong. But nice anyway... 8 from me. I think this got a chance for a ribbon...</td>', 'Nice one.... Maybe a little too much brush / blur on her eye brow, because the perspective seems wrong. But nice anyway... 8 from me. I think this got a chance for a ribbon...', '2004-03-27 17:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(641057, 65834, 2158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.', '2004-03-27 17:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(641064, 65777, 8891, '<td valign="top">looks a bit bright and hazy to me, and the detail on the surfer is not what I might expect on a magazine cover.</td>', 'looks a bit bright and hazy to me, and the detail on the surfer is not what I might expect on a magazine cover.', '2004-03-27 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(641066, 65632, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait and the woman is exceptionally pretty and her costume wonderful. Like the colors the lighting...just not the black background....I have not kept with National Geoprahic for some time but I never recall seeing a black BG. Just a thought, other wise great.</td>', 'Very nice portrait and the woman is exceptionally pretty and her costume wonderful. Like the colors the lighting...just not the black background....I have not kept with National Geoprahic for some time but I never recall seeing a black BG. Just a thought, other wise great.', '2004-03-27 17:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(641068, 65606, 8891, '<td valign="top">not a fan of the chocolate and strawberry combo, but it looks quite tasty and your lighting of it was very good....the background does nothing for me or the subject, IMHO.</td>', 'not a fan of the chocolate and strawberry combo, but it looks quite tasty and your lighting of it was very good....the background does nothing for me or the subject, IMHO.', '2004-03-27 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(641072, 65655, 8891, '<td valign="top">I could see a sharper version of this on time, so good idea and capture. but sharper is the problem for me with this.  Hey I thought Colleen Dewhurst died? Like how the one guy three rows back over Duyba''s head looks like he is about to stick his tongue out...LOL!  The people in general look dazed and confused or bored....can''t imagine why!</td>', 'I could see a sharper version of this on time, so good idea and capture. but sharper is the problem for me with this.  Hey I thought Colleen Dewhurst died? Like how the one guy three rows back over Duyba''s head looks like he is about to stick his tongue out...LOL!  The people in general look dazed and confused or bored....can''t imagine why!', '2004-03-27 17:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(641073, 65725, 8891, '<td valign="top">Cool....it really is a magazine, GREAT....so is the shot! like the height in the shot but it might not play on a cover for that reason, but the fine detail out weighs that for me.</td>', 'Cool....it really is a magazine, GREAT....so is the shot! like the height in the shot but it might not play on a cover for that reason, but the fine detail out weighs that for me.', '2004-03-27 17:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(641075, 65758, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the white duck, the black duck is really not as discernible.</td>', 'Nice detail on the white duck, the black duck is really not as discernible.', '2004-03-27 17:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(641076, 65700, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think we would rather use this for our Trail Magazine in that there does not appear to be anyone walking in your image.  Otherwise an excellent shot!</td>', 'I think we would rather use this for our Trail Magazine in that there does not appear to be anyone walking in your image.  Otherwise an excellent shot!', '2004-03-27 17:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(641077, 65926, 8891, '<td valign="top">Wassup with the colors, or lack there of.</td>', 'Wassup with the colors, or lack there of.', '2004-03-27 17:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
