(641839, 64921, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail here, good focus and use of dof.  I like the composition as well.  One could think the backside of the bird is on the back cover.  :-)</td>', 'Very nice detail here, good focus and use of dof.  I like the composition as well.  One could think the backside of the bird is on the back cover.  :-)', '2004-03-28 23:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
