(642071, 65867, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you doing something a little less revealing Jones.  The water drops made this shot for me and you achieved a great tonal range.  Well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Nice to see you doing something a little less revealing Jones.  The water drops made this shot for me and you achieved a great tonal range.  Well deserved ribbon.', '2004-03-29 02:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
