(642154, 65834, 18904, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I couldn''t as for more than a smart blur in the the blue chanel to eliminate some of the background noise. The over all red cast bothers me but I suppose most folks won''t notice it...</td>', 'Wonderful! I couldn''t as for more than a smart blur in the the blue chanel to eliminate some of the background noise. The over all red cast bothers me but I suppose most folks won''t notice it...', '2004-03-29 04:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
