(646077, 65077, 16188, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love these plants because of the subtle and complex color combinations they produce - you''ve captured it brilliantly.</td>', 'Wow!  I love these plants because of the subtle and complex color combinations they produce - you''ve captured it brilliantly.', '2004-03-31 16:10:42.000000', NULL, 0),
