(646120, 65824, 6870, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the kind words everyone. I don''t mind 4th; there are so many great shots in this challenge, and I''m very pleased with the photo myself. Keep shooting!</td>', 'Thanks for the kind words everyone. I don''t mind 4th; there are so many great shots in this challenge, and I''m very pleased with the photo myself. Keep shooting!', '2004-03-31 16:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(646248, 65867, 16093, '<td valign="top"><br/>Not sure if a black and white photo is a good idea for a cover shot. Not dramatic enough for a cover. Too much gray, would have been better  if added some color, maybe in the eyes, lips or back-drop. The model isn''t especially beautiful but again could have enhanced her looks with lighting and make-up. Interesting pose: motion of twist suggests a bit of quirkiness or madness. Not sexy in a sensual way - more of dirty provocative look. I would think this photo would be on the cover of a man''s mag rather than a fashion magazine. If this were in a fashion magazine it would probably be used for a story rather than on the cover.</td>', 'Not sure if a black and white photo is a good idea for a cover shot. Not dramatic enough for a cover. Too much gray, would have been better  if added some color, maybe in the eyes, lips or back-drop. The model isn''t especially beautiful but again could have enhanced her looks with lighting and make-up. Interesting pose: motion of twist suggests a bit of quirkiness or madness. Not sexy in a sensual way - more of dirty provocative look. I would think this photo would be on the cover of a man''s mag rather than a fashion magazine. If this were in a fashion magazine it would probably be used for a story rather than on the cover.', '2004-03-31 18:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
